所以要用 RGBA 图层 + alpha_composite。\n\n方案：每帧创建 overlay = Image.new('RGBA', (W,H), (0,0,0,0))，在上面画所有内容（带 alpha），然后 img = Image.alpha_composite(bg_rgba, overlay) 再转 RGB。\n\n每帧创建 RGBA 全屏图 + alpha_composite 成本可接受（1280x720 纯 Python? 不行，alpha_composite 是 C 实现，很快）。\n\n960 帧 * (new overlay + draw + composite + tobytes) — 应该 30-60s 内完成。可以。\n\n但注意：如果每个场景的淡入淡出都重新创建 overlay，没问题。\n\n设计细节（内容）：\n\n场景1 (0-4s)：封面\n- 大标题：「GitHub 账号被封」\n- 副标题：「3 步完整解封教程 + 申诉话术」\n- 一个圆形 GitHub 图标（用圆形+文字"GH"代替？或画 Octocat 太复杂）\n- 用圆角矩形画一个"被封"标记\n\n场景2 (4-10.5s)：Step 1 确认封禁类型\n- 标题：STEP 1 · 先搞清楚是哪种封禁\n- 两栏卡片：\n  - 卡片A：Misflagged / Spam 风控误判 → 可以解封（绿勾）\n  - 卡片B：真实违规（滥用、侵权、多号）→ 基本无解（红叉）\n- 提示：收到 "Your account has been flagged or suspended" 邮件 = 前者\n\n场景3 (10.5-17s)：Step 2 找到正确申诉入口\n- 标题：STEP 2 · 找到正确入口提交申诉\n- 内容：support.github.com/contact\n  选择「Account Suspension / Appeal」\n  填：用户名、邮箱、说明\n- 提示：不要用普通 ticket，要选 Appeal 分类\n\n场景4 (17-26s)：Step 3 申诉话术（重要，显示模板）\n- 标题：STEP 3 · 申诉话术模板（直接抄）\n- 英文模板卡片：\n  "Hi GitHub Support,\n  My account (username) was flagged by your spam detection system and appears to be a false positive. I have not engaged in spam, automation, or abusive activity. Could you please manually review my account and restore access?\n  Thank you."\n- 中文提示：态度客观、说明误判、请求人工复核\n\n场景5 (26-33s)：Step 4 提交之后\n- 标题：STEP 4 · 提交后怎么跟进\n- 三条：\n  - 等 1-3 个工作日，别重复刷 ticket（会被判定 spam）\n  - 不要切换 IP / 继续批量操作，会加重风控\n  - 收到回复按提示确认，通常会给 profile reset\n\n场景6 (33-40s)：结尾\n- 大标题：解封成功\n- 小字：本教程适用于 Spam 风控误封；真实违规无法申诉\n- 底部：祝好运\n\n底部步骤指示：5 个点。\n\n顶部进度条随总时间线性填充。\n\n开始写脚本。写到 ~/video_gen.py（我生成的文件，结束要删）。\n\n注意路径：Termux 的 /storage/emulated/0/Download 有权限访问（Termux 通常有存储权限）。\n\n输出文件：/storage/emulated/0/Download/github_unblock_tutorial_720p.mp4\n\n另外要不要加音频？用户没要求音频。"生成一段视频"，纯画面可接受。但加个静音音轨更规范（兼容播放器）。我用 -f lavfi anullsrc 加静音轨道，或者不加。加静音轨更安全，用 -shortest。\n\n其实不加音轨也没问题，很多播放器能播。但为了规范我加 anullsrc 静音 40s。\n\n现在写。\n\n字体索引探测：我先单独跑一个小命令测试。\n\n直接写进脚本里 try 多 index，取第一个能渲染 "号" 而不报错的。无法判断字形是否正确，但 Android CJK ttc 各 index 都能渲染大部分汉字。\n\n我先跑一个探测命令看有多少个 face。\n\n用 python: \n```python\nfrom PIL import ImageFont\nfor i in range(6):\n    try:\n        f=ImageFont.truetype('/system/fonts/NotoSansCJK-Regular.ttc', 40, index=i)\n        print(i, f.getname())\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(i,'ERR',e)\n```\n同时检查有没有 Bold 字体文件。\n\n先探测，再写脚本。同时可以并行探测。🔧 调用工具: batch_command\n参数: {"commands": ["python3 -c \\"\\nfrom PIL import ImageFont\\np='/system/fonts/NotoSansCJK-Regular.ttc'\\nfor i in range(8):\\n    try:\\n        f=ImageFont.truetype(p,40,index=i)\\n        print(i, f.getname())\\n    except Exception as e:\\n        print(i,'ERR')\\n\\"", "ls /system/fonts/ \p grep -i -E 'CJK\pDroid\pSC\pBold' \p head -30", "df -h /data /storage/emulated/0 \p tail -3"], "timeout": 60}\n结果: 批量执行 3 条命令：\n0 ('Noto Sans CJK JP', 'Regular')\n1 ('Noto Sans CJK KR', 'Regular')\n2 ('Noto Sans CJK SC', 'Regular')\n3 ('Noto Sans CJK TC', 'Regular')\n4 ('Noto Sans CJK HK', 'Regular')\n5 ('Noto Sans Mono CJK JP', 'Regular')\n6 ('Noto Sans Mono CJK KR', 'Regular')\n7 ('Noto Sans Mono CJK SC', 'Regular')\nAndroidClock.ttf\nCarroisGothicSC-Regular.ttf\nDancingScript-Bold.ttf\nDancingScript-Regular.ttf\nDroidSans-Bold.ttf\nDroidSans.ttf\nDroidSansMono.ttf\nNotoNaskhArabic-Bold.ttf\nNotoNaskhArabicUI-Bold.ttf\nNotoSansCJK-Regular.ttc\nNotoSansCanadianAboriginal-Regular.ttf\nNotoSansCarian-Regular.ttf\nNotoSansChakma-Regular.otf\nNotoSansCham-Bold.ttf\nNotoSansCham-Regular.ttf\nNotoSansCherokee-Regular.ttf\nNotoSansCoptic-Regular.ttf\nNotoSansCuneiform-Regular.ttf\nNotoSansCypriot-Regular.ttf\nNotoSansGujarati-Bold.ttf\nNotoSansGujaratiUI-Bold.ttf\nNotoSansHebrew-Bold.ttf\nNotoSansInscriptionalPahlavi-Regular.ttf\nNotoSansInscriptionalParthian-Regular.ttf\nNotoSansKhmerUI-Bold.ttf\nNotoSansLao-Bold.ttf\nNotoSansLaoUI-Bold.ttf\nNotoSansMyanmar-Bold.otf\nNotoSansMyanmarUI-Bold.otf\nNotoSansOriya-Bold.ttf\nFilesystem       Size Used Avail Use% Mounted on\n/dev/block/dm-19 107G  56G   51G  53% /data/user/0\n/dev/fuse        107G  56G   51G  53% /storage/emulated\n\n\n字体：index 2 = Noto Sans CJK SC（简体中文），available。Bold 用 DroidSans-Bold 只支持拉丁，中文粗体可以用 CJK SC 的... ttc 里只有 Regular。可以用 PIL 的 stroke_width 来模拟粗体，效果不错。\n\n空间充足 51G。\n\n现在写生成脚本。\n\n设计：1280x720，24fps，40s = 960 帧。\n\n我写一个完整脚本。\n\n关键实现：\n- 预渲染背景（渐变 + 网格 + 光晕）\n- 每帧创建 RGBA overlay，画内容，alpha_composite\n- 内容按时间轴分段，带淡入淡出\n\n写代码：\n\n```python\nimport os, subprocess, math\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw, ImageFont\n\nW, H = 1280, 720\nFPS = 24\nDUR = 40\nTOTAL = FPS * DUR\n\nFONT_CJK = '/system/fonts/NotoSansCJK-Regular.ttc'\n_fc = {}\ndef F(size, bold=False):\n    key = (size, bold)\n    if key in _fc: return _fc[key]\n    f = ImageFont.truetype(FONT_CJK, size, index=2)\n    _fc[key] = f\n    return f\n```\n\n粗体：用 draw.text(..., stroke_width=1, stroke_fill=color) 模拟。\n\n背景：\n```python\ndef make_bg():\n    # vertical gradient\n    top = (13,17,23)      # 0d1117\n    bot = (22,27,34)      # 161b22\n    grad = Image.new('RGB', (1, H))\n    for y in range(H):\n        t = y/(H-1)\n        # ease\n        r = int(top[0]+(bot[0]-top[0])*t)\n        ...\n        grad.putpixel((0,y),(r,g,b))\n    bg = grad.resize((W,H))\n```\n\n再加光晕：两个径向光斑（左上青绿、右下紫色），用 ImageFilter.GaussianBlur。\n\n网格：淡线。\n\n步骤：先做 bg（RGB），转 RGBA 存 base。\n\n每帧：\n```python\noverlay = Image.new('RGBA',(W,H),(0,0,0,0))\nd = ImageDraw.Draw(overlay)\n... draw ...\nframe = Image.alpha_composite(base, overlay).convert('RGB')\np = proc.stdin\np.write(frame.tobytes())\n```\n\nffmpeg 命令：\n```\nffmpeg -y -f rawvideo -pix_fmt rgb24 -s 1280x720 -r 24 -i - -f lavfi -i anullsrc=r=44100:cl=stereo -shortest -c:v libx264 -preset medium -crf 20 -pix_fmt yuv420p -profile:v high -level 4.0 -movflags +faststart out.mp4\n```\n注意 -shortest 与 rawvideo 输入长度由帧数决定，40s。音频 anullsrc 无限，-shortest 会截到 40s。\n\n好。\n\n按时间画内容，用场景函数。\n\n辅助绘制函数：\n- rounded_rect_card(draw, box, radius, fill_rgba, outline)\n- text with alpha: fill=(r,g,b,a)\n\n因为在 RGBA overlay 上画，alpha 会生效。\n\n我把每个场景写成一个函数，接受 (d, t_local, alpha) 其中 alpha 是整体透明度。\n\n淡入淡出：场景内 t 前 0.4s 淡入，后 0.5s 淡出。alpha = min(t/0.4, (dur-t)/0.5, 1)\n\n文字颜色乘 alpha。\n\n配合"元素逐个出现"的动效：每个元素有 delay，offset y 向上浮动 + alpha。\n\n我写一个类：\n\n```python\ndef ease(t):  # 0..1\n    return 1-(1-t)**3\n\ndef appear(d, start, dur, fn, t, alpha):\n    # 返回进度 0..1\n```\n\n简化：定义 helper\n\n```python\ndef a_in(t, start, dur=0.45):\n    if t < start: return 0.0\n    return min(1.0, (t-start)/dur)\n```\n然后元素 alpha = ease(a_in(...)) * scene_alpha。\n\n绘制文本时用 rgba。\n\n写具体场景：\n\n场景1: 0 - 4.0s — 封面\n- 居中大标题「GitHub 账号被误封？」 font 76, 白\n- 下一个稍慢出现：「完整解封教程 · 申诉话术模板」 font 40, 灰蓝\n- 顶部小标签「GITHUB · APPEAL GUIDE」 青色 字距\n- 一个装饰：圆形描边环\n    \n场景2: 4.0 - 10.5s — STEP 1\n标题区（左侧 x=90, y=100）：「STEP 1」 青色小字 + 「先判断：是误封还是真违规」 白色 56\n两栏卡片 y=280, 高 250\n 卡片A x=90 w=520: 标题「Spam 风控误判」 绿 (63,185,80)，副「邮件提示 flagged / suspended\\n但你没做违规操作」 描述「→ 可申诉解封」\n 卡片B x=670 w=520: 标题「真实违规」 红 (248,81,73)，副「滥用、侵权、多号、刷星」描述「→ 申诉成功率极低」\n\n场景3: 10.5 - 17s — STEP 2\n标题「STEP 2 / 找到正确的申诉入口」\n大卡片：support.github.com/contact （等宽/白），下面两行：\n · 分类选 Account Suspension / Appeal\n · 填用户名、注册邮箱、一句说明\n提示条：别走普通 ticket，选错分类会被当成 spam\n\n场景4: 17 - 26s — STEP 3 话术\n标题「STEP 3 / 申诉话术模板」\n卡片内英文模板（行距 40）：\nSubject: Appeal for account suspension\nHi GitHub Support,\nMy account (@yourname) was flagged by your spam\ndetection system — I believe this is a false positive.\nI have not used automation, spam, or abusive behavior.\nCould you please manually review and restore access?\nThanks!\n中文提示：客观陈述 + 强调误判 + 请求人工复核\n\n字体大小 26-28，英文用 CJK SC 也能渲染拉丁字符，OK。\n\n场景5: 26 - 33s — STEP 4 提交后\n标题「STEP 4 / 提交后怎么跟进」\n三条列表 with 编号圆圈：\n1 等 1–3 个工作日，别重复提交（会被判 spam）\n2 别换 IP、别继续批量操作，会加重风控\n3 收到回复按要求确认，通常会帮你 reset profile\n\n场景6: 33 - 40s — 结尾\n大标题「解封成功」 绿色\n小字「本方法适用于 Spam 风控误封」\n底部「真实违规无法通过申诉绕过」\n最后 1.5s 淡出到 logo 文字？\n\n底部进度：5 个圆点，当前高亮。\n顶部进度条：整体 t/DUR。\n\n好，开始写代码。注意执行时间，960 帧。\n\n为了速度，用 tobytes 写 pipe，subprocess。\n\n写文件：/data/data/com.termux/files/home/gen_video.py（我生成的临时文件，最后删）\n\n输出到 /storage/emulated/0/Download/GitHub解封教程_720p.mp4 — 中文文件名可能有问题？一般没问题。但为了稳妥用英文名：github_unblock_tutorial_720p.mp4\n\n开始写。\n\n注意 textbbox 用于居中。\n\n代码要小心，写完整。\n\n关于"别重复提交"里的 – 破折号，字体应该支持。\n\n现在写。\n\n另外，行距：用 draw.text 多次调用，手动 y 递增。\n\n写 helper:\n\n```python\ndef T(d, xy, s, size, color, alpha, bold=False, anchor='la'):\n    a = int(color[3]*alpha) if len(color)>3 else int(255*alpha)\n    fill = (color[0],color[1],color[2],a)\n    f = F(size, bold)\n    if bold:\n        d.text(xy, s, font=f, fill=fill, anchor=anchor, stroke_width=1, stroke_fill=fill)\n    else:\n        d.text(xy, s, font=f, fill=fill, anchor=anchor)\n```\n\n颜色定义时用 3 元组，alpha 传 0..1。\n\n好。\n\n卡片绘制：\n```python\ndef card(d, box, alpha, fill=(22,27,34), outline=(48,54,61), r=18):\n    x0,y0,x1,y1 = box\n    d.rounded_rectangle(box, radius=r, fill=fill+(int(255*alpha),), outline=outline+(int(255*alpha),), width=2)\n```\n\n好。\n\n现在仔细写场景函数，参数 (d, t, A) 其中 t 为场景局部时间，A 为场景整体 alpha。\n\n写吧。\n\n估计代码 300 行左右。\n\n对于场景4的英文模板，字体大小 25，行距 38。\n\n场景布局：标题 y=90，卡片 y=190 到 630。\n\n我尽量保证不超出 720 高度。\n\n开始。\n\n细节：顶部进度条在 y=0..6，宽 W * t/DUR，颜色青色渐变。\n\n底部指示点 y=690。\n\n场景 1 封面不放进度点？放也行，统一放。\n\n好，写代码。\n\n另外考虑：让画面不单调，每帧背景有轻微移动的网格线（视差）——可用一个缓慢平移的网格。但背景预渲染了，动态网格需要在 overlay 上画。简单点：预渲染一张 2W 宽的网格图，每帧裁切偏移。这样有一些生命力。\n\n实现：grid 图宽 W*2，每帧 offset = int(t*8) % 80，crop 出 W 宽。crop+paste 每帧一次，可接受。\n\n其实 base 是 RGB 预合成了渐变+光晕。网格需要在其上。我可以每帧：\nbase.copy() → paste grid crop 用 blend?\n\n简化：把网格也预渲染成 RGBA 大图，每帧 crop → alpha_composite。多一次 composite，成本可接受。\n\n嗯，为了性能，我就把网格直接烘进背景静态图，不做动态。画面已有元素出现动效，足够。\n\n不过我想加点动感：让两个光斑位置缓慢移动 —— 那需每帧重算模糊，太慢。\n\n折中：预渲染 3 张背景（光斑位置略有不同的），按时间交叉淡入？也复杂。\n\n算了，静态背景 + 元素动效已足够好。但可以在 overlay 上画一个缓慢旋转的细圆环装饰。\n\n好，开写。\n\n再考虑：40s 视频，内容 6 场景，节奏合理。\n\n写代码。\n\n关于 pipe 到 ffmpeg：使用 subprocess.Popen with stdin=PIPE。每帧 write。要处理 BrokenPipe。\n\n好。\n\n最后清理：删除 gen_video.py 和任何中间文件。视频是交付物，不删。\n\n现在写文件。\n\n我把脚本写全。\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\nimport os, subprocess, math, sys\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw, ImageFont, ImageFilter\n\nW, H = 1280, 720\nFPS = 24\nDUR = 40\nTOTAL = FPS * DUR\n\nOUT = '/storage/emulated/0/Download/github_unblock_tutorial_720p.mp4'\nFONT_PATH = '/system/fonts/NotoSansCJK-Regular.ttc'\n\n_font_cache = {}\ndef F(size):\n    if size in _font_cache: return _font_cache[size]\n    f = ImageFont.truetype(FONT_PATH, size, index=2)\n    _font_cache[size] = f\n    return f\n\nCYAN=(56,189,248); GREEN=(63,185,80); RED=(248,81,73); WHITE=(230,237,243)\nGREY=(139,148,158); DIM=(88,96,105); YELLOW=(240,180,60); PURPLE=(167,139,250)\n\ndef ease(t):\n    t=max(0.0,min(1.0,t)); return 1-(1-t)**3\n\ndef a_in(t, start, dur=0.45):\n    if t < start: return 0.0\n    return ease((t-start)/dur)\n\ndef T(d, xy, s, size, color, A=1.0, bold=False, anchor='la'):\n    a=int(round(255*max(0.0,min(1.0,A))))\n    if a<=0: return\n    fill=(color[0],color[1],color[2],a)\n    f=F(size)\n    if bold:\n        d.text(xy,s,font=f,fill=fill,anchor=anchor,stroke_width=1,stroke_fill=fill)\n    else:\n        d.text(xy,s,font=f,fill=fill,anchor=anchor)\n```\n\n背景：\n\n```python\ndef build_bg():\n    top=(11,15,20); bot=(23,29,38)\n    grad=Image.new('RGB',(1,H))\n    for y in range(H):\n        t=y/(H-1)\n        grad.putpixel((0,y), tuple(int(top[i]+(bot[i]-top[i])*t) for i in range(3)))\n    bg=grad.resize((W,H), Image.BILINEAR).convert('RGBA')\n\n    # glows\n    glow=Image.new('RGBA',(W,H),(0,0,0,0))\n    gd=ImageDraw.Draw(glow)\n    gd.ellipse([-260,-300,520,380], fill=(56,189,248,46))\n    gd.ellipse([W-420,H-380,W+260,H+300], fill=(167,139,250,38))\n    glow=glow.filter(ImageFilter.GaussianBlur(120))\n    bg=Image.alpha_composite(bg,glow)\n\n    # grid\n    grid=Image.new('RGBA',(W,H),(0,0,0,0))\n    gd=ImageDraw.Draw(grid)\n    for x in range(0,W+1,80):\n        gd.line([(x,0),(x,H)], fill=(255,255,255,8), width=1)\n    for y in range(0,H+1,80):\n        gd.line([(0,y),(W,y)], fill=(255,255,255,8), width=1)\n    bg=Image.alpha_composite(bg,grid)\n\n    # vignette\n    vig=Image.new('L',(W,H),0)\n    vd=ImageDraw.Draw(vig)\n    vd.ellipse([-W*0.35,-H*0.55,W*1.35,H*1.55], fill=255)\n    vig=vig.filter(ImageFilter.GaussianBlur(160))\n    dark=Image.new('RGBA',(W,H),(0,0,0,150))\n    inv=Image.eval(vig, lambda v: 255-v)\n    dark.putalpha(inv.point(lambda v: int(v*0.55)))\n    bg=Image.alpha_composite(bg,dark)\n    return bg\n```\n\n嗯 vignette 逻辑：dark 有 alpha = (255-v)*0.55，中心 v=255 → alpha 0，边缘 v=0 → alpha 140。对。\n\n卡片：\n\n```python\ndef card(d, box, A=1.0, fill=(22,27,34), outline=(48,54,61), r=20, w=2):\n    a=int(255*max(0,min(1,A)))\n    if a<=0: return\n    d.rounded_rectangle(box, radius=r, fill=fill+(a,), outline=outline+(a,), width=w)\n```\n\nheading helper:\n\n```python\ndef heading(d, t, tag, title, A, y=88):\n    # tag\n    p=a_in(t,0.0,0.4)\n    T(d,(80,y), tag, 26, CYAN, A*p, bold=True)\n    p2=a_in(t,0.12,0.45)\n    T(d,(80,y+40), title, 50, WHITE, A*p2, bold=True)\n    # underline\n    if a_in(t,0.25)>0:\n        p3=ease(a_in(t,0.25,0.5))\n        w=int(120*p3)\n        d.rounded_rectangle([80,y+104,80+w,y+110], radius=3, fill=CYAN+(int(255*A),))\n```\n\n嗯 标题 50 号字可能太宽，标题句子要短。\n\n标题：「先判断：误封还是真违规」 11 字 * 50 ≈ 550px，OK 宽 1280 够。\n\n现在写场景。\n\n场景1 (0→4.0)：\n```python\ndef scene_intro(d,t,A):\n    p=a_in(t,0.05,0.6)\n    T(d,(W/2, 150), 'GITHUB  ACCOUNT  APPEAL', 28, CYAN, A*p, bold=True, anchor='ma')\n    p=a_in(t,0.2,0.7)\n    T(d,(W/2, 235), 'GitHub 账号被误封？', 84, WHITE, A*p, bold=True, anchor='ma')\n    p=a_in(t,0.6,0.7)\n    T(d,(W/2, 360), '40 秒看完：判断 · 申诉 · 话术模板', 40, GREY, A*p, anchor='ma')\n    p=a_in(t,1.0,0.6)\n    # divider\n    d.rounded_rectangle([W/2-160, 445, W/2+160, 448], radius=2, fill=CYAN+(int(200*A*p),))\n    p=a_in(t,1.3,0.6)\n    T(d,(W/2, 490), '适用于 spam 风控误封 · 真实违规无法申诉', 30, DIM, A*p, anchor='ma')\n```\n另有装饰圆环。\n\n场景2 (4.0→10.5) dur 6.5\n```python\ndef scene_step1(d,t,A):\n    heading(d,t,'STEP 1','先判断：是误封，还是真违规',A,y=70)\n    # card A\n    p=a_in(t,0.5,0.5)\n    if p>0:\n        y_off=int((1-ease(p))*24)\n        box=[80,230+y_off,620,560+y_off]\n        card(d,box,A*p,fill=(20,32,26),outline=(46,90,58))\n        T(d,(112,258+y_off),'✔  Spam 风控误判',34,GREEN,A*p,bold=True)\n        lines=['收到 flagged / suspended 邮件','但你没刷星、没开小号、没批量操作','通常由自动风控误命中']\n        for i,ln in enumerate(lines):\n            T(d,(112,318+y_off+i*44),'· '+ln,26,GREY,A*p)\n        T(d,(112,470+y_off),'→  可申诉，成功率高',30,GREEN,A*p,bold=True)\n    ...\n```\n需要控制高度：box 230→560，内容到 500。OK\n\ncard B 同理，x 660→1200，红色。\n\n场景3 (10.5→17) dur 6.5: STEP 2\n```python\ndef scene_step2(d,t,A):\n    heading(d,t,'STEP 2','找到正确的申诉入口',A,y=70)\n    p=a_in(t,0.45,0.5)\n    card(d,[80,230,1200,400], A*p, fill=(19,26,35), outline=(45,66,90))\n    T(d,(112,255),'support.github.com/contact',32,CYAN,A*p,bold=True)\n    T(d,(112,315),'分类选 Account Suspension / Appeal',26,GREY,A*p)\n    ...\n```\n再加两行要点和一条提示。\n\n场景4 (17→26) dur 9: STEP 3 话术\n标题 + 大卡片，英文模板行。\n\n行数约 7 行 * 36 = 252 + padding。\n\n```python\nlines=[\n 'Subject:  Appeal for account suspension',\n 'Hi GitHub Support,',\n 'My account (@yourname) was flagged by your spam',\n 'detection system — I believe this is a false positive.',\n 'I have not used automation, spam, or abusive behavior.',\n 'Could you please manually review my account and',\n 'restore access? Thank you.',\n]\n```\n从 y=232 开始，行距 38。\n\n提示条 y=530。\n\n场景5 (26→33) dur 7: STEP 4 跟进\n三条，带圆圈编号。\n\n场景6 (33→40) dur 7: 结尾\n- 大字「解封成功」绿\n- 副标题\n- 最后淡出？\n\n时间轴我再核对下：intro 0-4, step1 4-10.5, step2 10.5-17, step3 17-26, step4 26-33, outro 33-40。总 40。✓\n\n每场景淡出：最后 0.45s 淡出。\n\n主循环：\n\n```python\nscenes=[(0.0,4.0,scene_intro),(4.0,10.5,scene_step1),(10.5,17.0,scene_step2),(17.0,26.0,scene_step3),(26.0,33.0,scene_step4),(33.0,40.0,scene_outro)]\n\nfor i in range(TOTAL):\n    tt=i/FPS\n    ov=Image.new('RGBA',(W,H),(0,0,0,0))\n    d=ImageDraw.Draw(ov)\n    for (s,e,fn) in scenes:\n        if s<=tt<e:\n            lt=tt-s; dur=e-s\n            A=1.0\n            if lt<0.4: A=lt/0.4\n            if dur-lt<0.5: A=min(A,(dur-lt)/0.5)\n            fn(d,lt,A)\n    # 顶部进度条\n    ...\n    frame=Image.alpha_composite(bg,ov).convert('RGB')\n    proc.stdin.write(frame.tobytes())\n```\n\n进度条：\n```python\nprog=tt/DUR\nd.rounded_rectangle([0,0,W,6],radius=0,fill=(30,36,44,255))\nd.rounded_rectangle([0,0,max(6,int(W*prog)),6],fill=CYAN+(255,))\n```\n\n底部点：\n```python\nn=6; dots_w=n*34\nx0=W/2-(dots_w-34)/2\nfor k in range(n):\n    cx=x0+k*34; cy=690\n    active = current scene index == k\n    r=6 if not active else 8\n    col = CYAN if active else DIM\n    d.ellipse([cx-r,cy-r,cx+r,cy+r], fill=col+(255,))\n```\n但 intro 和 outro 也占点，可以只显示 4 步（step1-4）。简单点：6 个点包含 intro/outro，无所谓。\n\n其实用 4 个点表示 STEP 1-4 更专业。我就画 4 个点，只在 step 场景或全程都画。全程画 4 点，指示当前 step。\n\n我在主循环里算 step_idx：step1→0, step2→1, step3→2, step4→3；其他 -1（不画或都不高亮）。\n\n那就在场景函数外部画。需要知道当前场景。用 scene index 判断。\n\n好，写。\n\n编码命令：\n\n```python\ncmd=['ffmpeg','-y','-f','rawvideo','-pix_fmt','rgb24','-s',f'{W}x{H}','-r',str(FPS),'-i','-',\n     '-f','lavfi','-i','anullsrc=channel_layout=stereo:sample_rate=44100',\n     '-shortest','-c:v','libx264','-preset','medium','-crf','20','-pix_fmt','yuv420p',\n     '-profile:v','high','-level','4.0','-c:a','aac','-b:a','64k','-movflags','+faststart', OUT]\n```\n\nrun with stdin=PIPE, stdout=DEVNULL, stderr=PIPE?\n\nstderr 收集最后几行用于报错。\n\n写完脚本后执行，再验证 ffprobe。\n\n好，现在写文件。\n\n注意：Termux 中文文件名 OK 但避免麻烦用英文。\n\n写。🔧 调用工具: create_file\n参数: {"path": "/data/data/com.termux/files/home/gen_video.py", "content": "#!/usr/bin/env python3\\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\\n\\"\\"\\"生成 40 秒 720p GitHub 解封教程视频\\"\\"\\"\\nimport os, sys, subprocess, math\\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw, ImageFont, ImageFilter\\n\\nW, H = 1280, 720\\nFPS = 24\\nDUR = 40\\nTOTAL = FPS * DUR\\nOUT = '/storage/emulated/0/Download/github_unblock_tutorial_720p.mp4'\\nFONT_PATH = '/system/fonts/NotoSansCJK-Regular.ttc'\\n\\n_fc = {}\\ndef F(size):\\n    if size not in _fc:\\n        _fc[size] = ImageFont.truetype(FONT_PATH, size, index=2)\\n    return _fc[size]\\n\\nCYAN   = (56, 189, 248)\\nGREEN  = (63, 185, 80)\\nRED    = (248, 81, 73)\\nWHITE  = (230, 237, 243)\\nGREY   = (154, 163, 175)\\nDIM    = (99, 110, 123)\\nYELLOW = (240, 180, 60)\\nPURPLE = (167, 139, 250)\\n\\ndef ease(t):\\n    t = max(0.0, min(1.0, t))\\n    return 1 - (1 - t) ** 3\\n\\ndef a_in(t, start, dur=0.45):\\n    if t < start:\\n        return 0.0\\n    return ease((t - start) / dur)\\n\\ndef T(d, xy, s, size, color, A=1.0, bold=False, anchor='la'):\\n    a = int(round(255 * max(0.0, min(1.0, A))))\\n    if a <= 0:\\n        return\\n    fill = (color[0], color[1], color[2], a)\\n    f = F(size)\\n    if bold:\\n        d.text(xy, s, font=f, fill=fill, anchor=anchor, stroke_width=1, stroke_fill=fill)\\n    else:\\n        d.text(xy, s, font=f, fill=fill, anchor=anchor)\\n\\ndef card(d, box, A=1.0, fill=(22, 27, 34), outline=(48, 54, 61), r=20, w=2):\\n    a = int(255 * max(0.0, min(1.0, A)))\\n    if a <= 0:\\n        return\\n    d.rounded_rectangle(box, radius=r, fill=fill + (a,), outline=outline + (a,), width=w)\\n\\ndef build_bg():\\n    top = (11, 15, 20); bot = (24, 30, 39)\\n    grad = Image.new('RGB', (1, H))\\n    for y in range(H):\\n        t = y / (H - 1)\\n        grad.putpixel((0, y), tuple(int(top[i] + (bot[i] - top[i]) * t) for i in range(3)))\\n    bg = grad.resize((W, H), Image.BILINEAR).convert('RGBA')\\n\\n    glow = Image.new('RGBA', (W, H), (0, 0, 0, 0))\\n    gd = ImageDraw.Draw(glow)\\n    gd.ellipse([-280, -320, 540, 400], fill=(56, 189, 248, 50))\\n    gd.ellipse([W - 460, H - 400, W + 280, H + 320], fill=(167, 139, 250, 42))\\n    glow = glow.filter(ImageFilter.GaussianBlur(130))\\n    bg = Image.alpha_composite(bg, glow)\\n\\n    grid = Image.new('RGBA', (W, H), (0, 0, 0, 0))\\n    gd = ImageDraw.Draw(grid)\\n    for x in range(0, W + 1, 80):\\n        gd.line([(x, 0), (x, H)], fill=(255, 255, 255, 9), width=1)\\n    for y in range(0, H + 1, 80):\\n        gd.line([(0, y), (W, y)], fill=(255, 255, 255, 9), width=1)\\n    bg = Image.alpha_composite(bg, grid)\\n\\n    vig = Image.new('L', (W, H), 0)\\n    vd = ImageDraw.Draw(vig)\\n    vd.ellipse([-W * 0.35, -H * 0.55, W * 1.35, H * 1.55], fill=255)\\n    vig = vig.filter(ImageFilter.GaussianBlur(170))\\n    mask = vig.point(lambda v: int((255 - v) * 0.58))\\n    dark = Image.new('RGBA', (W, H), (0, 0, 0, 255))\\n    dark.putalpha(mask)\\n    bg = Image.alpha_composite(bg, dark)\\n    return bg\\n\\ndef heading(d, t, tag, title, A, y=64, color=CYAN):\\n    p = a_in(t, 0.0, 0.4)\\n    T(d, (80, y), tag, 26, color, A * p, bold=True)\\n    p2 = a_in(t, 0.10, 0.5)\\n    T(d, (80, y + 38), title, 50, WHITE, A * p2, bold=True)\\n    p3 = a_in(t, 0.22, 0.5)\\n    if p3 > 0:\\n        w = int(130 * ease(p3))\\n        d.rounded_rectangle([80, y + 108, 80 + max(w, 2), y + 114], radius=3,\\n                            fill=color + (int(255 * A * p3),))\\n\\n# ---------------- 场景 ----------------\\ndef scene_intro(d, t, A):\\n    # 装饰环\\n    p = a_in(t, 0.0, 0.8)\\n    if p > 0:\\n        r = 190 * ease(p)\\n        for k, col in ((0, CYAN), (1, PURPLE)):\\n            rr = r - k * 34\\n            if rr > 10:\\n                d.ellipse([W / 2 - rr, 385 - rr, W / 2 + rr, 385 + rr],\\n                          outline=col + (int(60 * A * p),), width=2)\\n\\n    p = a_in(t, 0.05, 0.6)\\n    T(d, (W / 2, 132), 'GITHUB   ACCOUNT   APPEAL', 26, CYAN, A * p, bold=True, anchor='ma')\\n\\n    p = a_in(t, 0.22, 0.7)\\n    T(d, (W / 2, 210), 'GitHub 账号被误封？', 82, WHITE, A * p, bold=True, anchor='ma')\\n\\n    p = a_in(t, 0.62, 0.7)\\n    T(d, (W / 2, 340), '40 秒看完：判断 · 申诉 · 话术模板', 38, GREY, A * p, anchor='ma')\\n\\n    p = a_in(t, 0.95, 0.6)\\n    if p > 0:\\n        w = int(170 * ease(p))\\n        d.rounded_rectangle([W / 2 - w, 424, W / 2 + w, 428], radius=2,\\n                            fill=CYAN + (int(220 * A * p),))\\n\\n    p = a_in(t, 1.25, 0.7)\\n    T(d, (W / 2, 470), '适用于 spam 风控误封 · 真实违规无法申诉', 28, DIM, A * p, anchor='ma')\\n\\ndef scene_step1(d, t, A):\\n    heading(d, t, 'STEP 1', '先判断：是误封，还是真违规', A)\\n\\n    # 左卡：误封\\n    p = a_in(t, 0.45, 0.55)\\n    if p > 0:\\n        off = int((1 - ease(p)) * 28)\\n        box = [80, 232 + off, 620, 588 + off]\\n        card(d, box, A * p, fill=(18, 33, 26), outline=(45, 96, 60))\\n        T(d, (112, 262 + off), '✔   Spam 风控误判', 32, GREEN, A * p, bold=True)\\n        ls = ['收到 flagged / suspended 邮件', '但没刷星、没开小号、没批量操作', '多半是自动风控误命中']\\n        for i, ln in enumerate(ls):\\n            T(d, (114, 330 + off + i * 46), '·  ' + ln, 25, GREY, A * p)\\n        T(d, (114, 500 + off), '→  可申诉，成功率较高', 29, GREEN, A * p, bold=True)\\n\\n    # 右卡：真违规\\n    p = a_in(t, 1.0, 0.55)\\n    if p > 0:\\n        off = int((1 - ease(p)) * 28)\\n        box = [660, 232 + off, 1200, 588 + off]\\n        card(d, box, A * p, fill=(34, 20, 21), outline=(104, 44, 44))\\n        T(d, (692, 262 + off), '✘   真实违规', 32, RED, A * p, bold=True)\\n        ls = ['滥用、刷星、侵权、多小号', '违反 Acceptable Use Policies', '被人工确认过的违规']\\n        for i, ln in enumerate(ls):\\n            T(d, (694, 330 + off + i * 46), '·  ' + ln, 25, GREY, A * p)\\n        T(d, (694, 500 + off), '→  申诉基本无效', 29, RED, A * p, bold=True)\\n\\ndef scene_step2(d, t, A):\\n    heading(d, t, 'STEP 2', '找到正确的申诉入口', A)\\n\\n    p = a_in(t, 0.45, 0.55)\\n    if p > 0:\\n        off = int((1 - ease(p)) * 26)\\n        card(d, [80, 232 + off, 1200, 404 + off], A * p, fill=(17, 25, 34), outline=(40, 70, 96))\\n        T(d, (112, 258 + off), 'support.github.com/contact', 34, CYAN, A * p, bold=True)\\n        T(d, (112, 325 + off), '分类必须选：Account Suspension  /  Appeal', 26, GREY, A * p)\\n\\n    p = a_in(t, 1.15, 0.55)\\n    if p > 0:\\n        off = int((1 - ease(p)) * 26)\\n        card(d, [80, 434 + off, 1200, 600 + off], A * p, fill=(22, 27, 34), outline=(48, 54, 61))\\n        T(d, (112, 462 + off), '在申诉表单里填写', 24, DIM, A * p, bold=True)\\n        T(d, (114, 508 + off), '①  你的 GitHub 用户名        ②  注册邮箱', 27, WHITE, A * p)\\n        T(d, (114, 552 + off), '③  一句话说明：被 spam 系统误标', 27, WHITE, A * p)\\n\\n    p = a_in(t, 1.9, 0.55)\\n    if p > 0:\\n        T(d, (80, 622), '⚠  别走普通 ticket，分类选错会被当 spam 忽略', 27, YELLOW, A * p, bold=True)\\n\\ndef scene_step3(d, t, A):\\n    heading(d, t, 'STEP 3', '申诉话术模板（直接抄）', A)\\n\\n    p = a_in(t, 0.45, 0.55)\\n    if p > 0:\\n        off = int((1 - ease(p)) * 26)\\n        card(d, [80, 226 + off, 1200, 556 + off], A * p, fill=(15, 22, 30), outline=(40, 70, 96))\\n        d.rounded_rectangle([80, 226 + off, 1200, 230 + off], radius=2,\\n                            fill=CYAN + (int(220 * A * p),))\\n        lines = [\\n            ('Subject:  Appeal for account suspension', CYAN),\\n            ('Hi GitHub Support,', GREY),\\n            ('My account (@yourname) was flagged by your spam', GREY),\\n            ('detection system — I believe this is a false positive.', GREY),\\n            ('I have not used automation, spam, or abusive behavior.', GREY),\\n            ('Could you please manually review my account and', GREY),\\n            ('restore access? Thank you.', GREY),\\n        ]\\n        for i, (ln, col) in enumerate(lines):\\n            pp = a_in(t, 0.6 + i * 0.16, 0.4)\\n            T(d, (112, 256 + off + i * 40), ln, 25, col, A * p * pp)\\n\\n    p = a_in(t, 2.1, 0.6)\\n    if p > 0:\\n        T(d, (80, 590), '三要素：客观陈述  ·  强调误判  ·  请求人工复核', 27, GREEN, A * p, bold=True)\\n    p = a_in(t, 2.6, 0.6)\\n    T(d, (80, 640), '别骂人、别辩解技术细节，越简洁越快过', 25, DIM, A * p)\\n\\ndef scene_step4(d, t, A):\\n    heading(d, t, 'STEP 4', '提交之后怎么跟进', A)\\n\\n    items = [\\n        ('1', '等 1–3 个工作日，别重复刷 ticket', '重复提交会被判成 spam，反而拖慢'),\\n        ('2', '别换 IP、别继续批量操作', '风控画像还在，只会加重嫌疑'),\\n        ('3', '收到回复就按要求确认', '人工复核通过后通常帮你 reset profile'),\\n    ]\\n    for i, (num, title, sub) in enumerate(items):\\n        p = a_in(t, 0.45 + i * 0.55, 0.55)\\n        if p <= 0:\\n            continue\\n        off = int((1 - ease(p)) * 26)\\n        y = 236 + off + i * 140\\n        card(d, [80, y, 1200, y + 116], A * p, fill=(22, 27, 34), outline=(48, 54, 61), r=16)\\n        d.ellipse([108, y + 34, 156, y + 82], fill=CYAN + (int(255 * A * p),))\\n        T(d, (132, y + 58), num, 30, (11, 15, 20), A * p, bold=True, anchor='mm')\\n        T(d, (180, y + 24), title, 30, WHITE, A * p, bold=True)\\n        T(d, (180, y + 68), sub, 23, GREY, A * p)\\n\\ndef scene_outro(d, t, A):\\n    p = a_in(t, 0.05, 0.5)\\n    if p > 0:\\n        r = 150 * ease(p)\\n        d.ellipse([W / 2 - r, 250 - r, W / 2 + r, 250 + r],\\n                  outline=GREEN + (int(70 * A * p),), width=3)\\n\\n    p = a_in(t, 0.15, 0.6)\\n    T(d, (W / 2, 200), '解封成功', 86, GREEN, A * p, bold=True, anchor='ma')\\n\\n    p = a_in(t, 0.7, 0.6)\\n    T(d, (W / 2, 330), '人工复核通过 = 账号恢复 + 仓库重回可见', 32, WHITE, A * p, anchor='ma')\\n\\n    p = a_in(t, 1.2, 0.6)\\n    T(d, (W / 2, 398), '本方法只适用于风控误封', 27, GREY, A * p, anchor='ma')\\n    p = a_in(t, 1.5, 0.6)\\n    T(d, (W / 2, 440), '真实违规无法通过申诉绕过', 27, RED, A * p, anchor='ma')\\n\\n    p = a_in(t, 2.1, 0.7)\\n    if p > 0:\\n        w = int(150 * ease(p))\\n        d.rounded_rectangle([W / 2 - w, 500, W / 2 + w, 503], radius=2,\\n                            fill=DIM + (int(180 * A * p),))\\n    p = a_in(t, 2.4, 0.7)\\n    T(d, (W / 2, 530), '祝申诉顺利', 30, CYAN, A * p, anchor='ma')\\n\\nSCENES = [\\n    (0.0, 4.0, scene_intro, -1),\\n    (4.0, 10.5, scene_step1, 0),\\n    (10.5, 17.0, scene_step2, 1),\\n    (17.0, 26.0, scene_step3, 2),\\n    (26.0, 33.0, scene_step4, 3),\\n    (33.0, 40.0, scene_outro, -1),\\n]\\n\\ndef main():\\n    bg = build_bg()\\n    cmd = ['ffmpeg', '-y', '-hide_banner', '-loglevel', 'error',\\n           '-f', 'rawvideo', '-pix_fmt', 'rgb24', '-s', f'{W}x{H}', '-r', str(FPS), '-i', '-',\\n           '-f', 'lavfi', '-i', 'anullsrc=channel_layout=stereo:sample_rate=44100',\\n           '-shortest',\\n           '-c:v', 'libx264', '-preset', 'medium', '-crf', '20', '-pix_fmt', 'yuv420p',\\n           '-profile:v', 'high', '-level', '4.0',\\n           '-c:a', 'aac', '-b:a', '64k',\\n           '-movflags', '+faststart', OUT]\\n    proc = subprocess.Popen(cmd, stdin=subprocess.PIPE,\\n                            stdout=subprocess.DEVNULL, stderr=subprocess.PIPE)\\n\\n    for i in range(TOTAL):\\n        tt = i / FPS\\n        ov = Image.new('RGBA', (W, H), (0, 0, 0, 0))\\n        d = ImageDraw.Draw(ov)\\n\\n        cur_step = -1\\n        for (s, e, fn, step) in SCENES:\\n            if s <= tt < e:\\n                lt = tt - s\\n                dur = e - s\\n                A = 1.0\\n                if lt < 0.4:\\n                    A = lt / 0.4\\n                if dur - lt < 0.5:\\n                    A = min(A, (dur - lt) / 0.5)\\n                fn(d, lt, A)\\n                cur_step = step\\n                break\\n\\n        # 顶部进度条\\n        prog = tt / DUR\\n        d.rectangle([0, 0, W, 5], fill=(28, 34, 42, 255))\\n        d.rectangle([0, 0, max(2, int(W * prog)), 5], fill=CYAN + (255,))\\n\\n        # 底部 STEP 指示点\\n        n = 4\\n        gap = 38\\n        x0 = W / 2 - (n - 1) * gap / 2\\n        for k in range(n):\\n            cx = x0 + k * gap\\n            cy = 676\\n            if k == cur_step:\\n                d.ellipse([cx - 8, cy - 8, cx + 8, cy + 8], fill=CYAN + (255,))\\n            else:\\n                d.ellipse([cx - 5, cy - 5, cx + 5, cy + 5], fill=DIM + (255,))\\n\\n        frame = Image.alpha_composite(bg, ov).convert('RGB')\\n        try:\\n            proc.stdin.write(frame.tobytes())\\n        except BrokenPipeError:\\n            print('ffmpeg pipe broken at frame', i)\\n            break\\n        if i % 120 == 0:\\n            print(f'frame {i}/{TOTAL}', flush=True)\\n\\n    proc.stdin.close()\\n    err = proc.stderr.read().decode('utf-8', 'ignore')\\n    rc = proc.wait()\\n    print('ffmpeg rc =', rc)\\n    if err.strip():\\n        print('ffmpeg log:', err[-2000:])\\n    return rc\\n\\nif __name__ == '__main__':\\n    sys.exit(main())\\n"}\n结果: ✅ 创建 /data/data/com.termux/files/home/gen_video.py (12642 字节)\n\n现在运行。960 帧，可能耗时。用 run_background 或直接 execute_command 带长超时。\n\n先直接