n2. 震惊 (6-12s): 屏幕上出现 "Your account has been suspended"\n3. 误区 (12-20s): 小陈开始慌乱，想注册小号、换IP、狂发邮件 —— 错误做法（红色警示）\n4. 转折 (20-28s): 冷静下来，学会分辨封禁类型\n5. 行动 (28-38s): 找到申诉入口，填写表单\n6. 申诉信 (38-50s): 话术模板，逐行展示\n7. 等待 (50-58s): 等待期，焦虑，进度条\n8. 解封 (58-66s): 收到 GitHub Support 邮件，账号恢复\n9. 收尾 (66-72s): 总结要点\n\nThat's ~72 seconds. Good.\n\nVoiceover script per scene with timing. I'll use edge-tts to generate audio per scene, then measure durations, then build frame timeline to match.\n\nApproach: generate voiceover segment per scene → get durations via ffprobe → define scene durations from audio duration + padding → total video duration → render frames accordingly → mix audio (voiceover at position + BGM ducked).\n\nLet me first test edge-tts.\n\nAlso need to check ffmpeg has libx264 and aac — yes from previous work.\n\nFont: index 2 = Noto Sans CJK SC. Let me verify path.\n\nLet me test edge-tts now.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "cd /tmp && mkdir -p vt && cd vt && python3 -c \\"\\nimport asyncio, edge_tts\\nasync def m():\\n    c = edge_tts.Communicate('凌晨两点，小陈打开电脑，准备提交他的毕业设计', 'zh-CN-YunxiNeural')\\n    await c.save('/tmp/vt/test.mp3')\\nasyncio.run(m())\\nprint('ok')\\n\\" 2>&1 \p tail -5; ls -l /tmp/vt/ 2>/dev/null; ffprobe -v error -show_entries format=duration -of csv=p=0 /tmp/vt/test.mp3 2>&1", "timeout": 120}\n结果: sh: 1: cd: can't cd to /tmp\n/tmp/vt/test.mp3: No such file or directory\n\n\n🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "fc-list 2>/dev/null \p grep -i \\"cjk\\" \p head -6", "timeout": 30}\n结果: (成功，无输出)\n\n/tmp doesn't exist in Termux (or maps elsewhere). Use $HOME/tmp or $TMPDIR. Let me use /data/data/com.termux/files/home/vt.\n\nfc-list not found. Let me find the font path used before. Previously "index 2" from a font file. Let me locate CJK font.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "mkdir -p ~/vt && cd ~/vt && python3 -c \\"\\nimport asyncio, edge_tts\\nasync def m():\\n    c = edge_tts.Communicate('凌晨两点，小陈打开电脑，准备提交他的毕业设计', 'zh-CN-YunxiNeural')\\n   