ine per-scene a list of (text, font, color, pos, anchor, t_start, t_dur, dy).\n\nLet me write generic `reveal(items, t)` that draws each item with alpha based on (t - t_start)/t_dur.\n\nNow writing the code. It'll be long (~700 lines). Let me be careful.\n\nKey: encode via pipe to ffmpeg.\n\n```python\nproc = subprocess.Popen(['ffmpeg','-y','-f','rawvideo','-pix_fmt','rgb24','-s','1920x1080','-r','60','-i','-','-an','-c:v','libx264','-preset','veryfast','-crf','18','-pix_fmt','yuv420p','-movflags','+faststart', out], stdin=PIPE)\n```\n\nThen proc.stdin.write(frame.tobytes())\n\nAudio mixing: after video, build audio with numpy at 48kHz.\n\nSteps for audio:\n- decode each narration mp3 → wav 48k mono (ffmpeg)\n- load into numpy, place at offsets\n- BGM: synthesize 100s+ of music with layers\n- SFX: synth\n- mix, normalize to peak 0.89, write wav 48k stereo\n- mux with video: -c:v copy -c:a aac\n\nBGM design (better than last time, since user complained monotone):\n- 92 BPM, key A minor? Let's do D minor for emotional storytelling? Or C major warm. Story is tense→resolve. Use A minor for tension, resolving to C major at end. That's a nice musical arc!\n- Sections: \n  - 0-10s: sparse pad (Am), soft\n  - 10-25s: add low pulse (tension)\n  - 25-45s: add arpeggio + light drums\n  - 45-70s: fuller\n  - 70-90s: resolve to F/C major, warm\n  - 90-end: thin out, final chord\n- Instruments synthesized: pad (detuned saws w/ lowpass), piano-ish (harmonics with decay), bass (sine+odd harmonics), bell (FM), kick, hat, snare-ish noise\n- Add reverb via simple comb/allpass or multi-tap delay\n\nI'll write a compact synth. Also duck BGM under narration: compute envelope from voice track, apply gain reduction.\n\nSFX:\n- typing clicks during S6/S7 — maybe skip, could clutter\n- notification ding at S9 start\n- error thud at S2 banner appear\n- success chime at S9 when status flips\n- whoosh at scene transitions (subtle)\nLet me add: error thud (S2), ding + chime (S9), soft whoosh at a few transitions, and keyboard clicks during S6 typing (light).\n\nOK, let me write the renderer now. I'll split into two files: render.py (video) and audio.py (audio), then mux.\n\nLet me write render.py.\n\nI'll be careful with ImageDraw API: rounded_rectangle exists in PIL 12. Good.\n\nFor rotated stamp: render text sprite, rotate with expand, paste.\n\nLet me write.\n\nNote: for performance, avoid ImageFilter.GaussianBlur per frame. Cache shadow panels.\n\nLet me define cache dict `_cache`.\n\nImplementation of panel with shadow:\n```python\ndef panel(img, box, r=20, fill=(18,26,42), border=(44,60,88), bw=2, shadow=True):\n    key = ('panel', box, r, fill, border, bw)\n    if shadow:\n        # draw shadow layer cached\n```\nSince fill colors vary, cache key includes them. Fine.\n\nDraw shadow: create RGBA (w+80, h+80), rounded rect black alpha 100 offset by (0,16), blur 16, paste at (x-40,y-40+16).\n\nThen draw panel rounded rect on main image.\n\nOK writing now.\n\nFor the gradient background base, precompute once per scene id (they only differ by accent color maybe). I'll precompute one shared base + per-scene accent blob sprites. Good: one base for all scenes (saves memory/time), plus animated blobs pasted per frame.\n\nGrid + noise: precompute.\n\nVignette: precompute radial alpha mask as L image, then per frame... no, bake into base directly (multiply). Base includes vignette. Good.\n\nAnimated blobs: 3 sprites of radial gradient in accent colors, sizes ~900px, alpha ~40. Paste with per-frame offset. Paste cost with alpha ~ fine.\n\nActually pasting large RGBA sprites (900x900) 3 times per frame = 2.4M pixel alpha composite → maybe 10ms. Acceptable.\n\nTo speed up, use smaller blobs (700px) and 2 of them.\n\nLet me estimate total per frame: base copy 3ms + blobs 8ms + elements 10ms + particles 5ms = ~26ms → 6300 frames = 164s. Plus encode. OK ~4-5 min total. Acceptable.\n\nParticles: 36 dots; draw as small sprites (12x12) with alpha → 36 * 0.1ms = 4ms. Fine.\n\nLet me write the code now.\n\nI need to know scene start times computed from timing.json.\n\nLet me write render.py to read timing.json.\n\nScene GAP = 0.8s; LEAD = 1.5s; TAIL = 3.0s.\nTotal = 1.5 + sum(dur+0.8) + 3.0 = 1.5 + 97.92 + 8 + 3 = 110.42s. Hmm that's 6625 frames.\n\nThat's a bit long for rendering but ok. Maybe reduce GAP to 0.6 → 108.4s.\n\nFine, ~108s, 6500 frames.\n\nLet me write.\n\nOne more: the dip-to-dark at boundaries — implement brightness factor:\nat scene start: first 0.35s factor from 0.55→1; at scene end: last 0.35s →1→0.55. Applied via numpy multiply on the frame (fast: 1920*1080*3 = 6.2M ops ≈ 8ms). Only do the multiply when factor<1 to save time.\n\nGood.\n\nNow, code.\n\nFor text rendering colors: \nblue accent (88,166,255), green (63,185,80), red (248,81,73), amber (240,180,41), text light (230,237,246), muted (140,158,184).\n\nLet me write the file.\n\nI'll write it in one create_file call. Long but let's go.\n\nCareful details:\n- ImageFont.truetype with index param: `ImageFont.truetype(path, size, index=2)`.\n- font.getbbox / getlength.\n\nSprite creation:\n```python\ndef _sprite(text, fkey, color, stroke=0):\n    key=(text,fkey,color,stroke)\n    s=_cache.get(key)\n    if s is None:\n        f=font(fkey)\n        tmp=Image.new('RGBA',(10,10))\n        d=ImageDraw.Draw(tmp)\n        bb=d.textbbox((0,0),text,font=f,stroke_width=stroke)\n        w=bb[2]-bb[0]+4+stroke*2; h=bb[3]-bb[1]+4+stroke*2\n        s=Image.new('RGBA',(max(4,w),max(4,h)),(0,0,0,0))\n        dd=ImageDraw.Draw(s)\n        dd.text((2+stroke-bb[0],2+stroke-bb[1]),text,font=f,fill=color+(255,),stroke_width=stroke,stroke_fill=color+(255,) if stroke else None)\n        _cache[key]=s\n    return s\n```\nHmm stroke_fill should be same color for bold-fake. But for outline effect different color. I'll add stroke_fill param.\n\nThen:\n```python\ndef blit(img, x, y, s, alpha=1.0, anchor='lt'):\n    if alpha<=0.003: return\n    w,h=s.size\n    if anchor=='ct': x-=w//2\n    elif anchor=='rt': x-=w\n    elif anchor=='cm': x-=w//2; y-=h//2\n    elif anchor=='cb': x-=w//2; y-=h\n    if alpha>=0.995:\n        img.paste(s,(x,y),s)\n    else:\n        a=s.getchannel('A').point(lambda v: int(v*alpha))\n        img.paste(s,(x,y),a)\n```\npoint with lambda per-pixel on small sprite fine.\n\nWait: `img.paste(s,(x,y),a)` where img is RGB and s is RGBA — paste uses mask a, ignores s alpha. Good.\n\nNegative coords: paste handles clipping for negative? PIL paste with negative box coords works (crops). Yes it handles it.\n\nBut if x,y negative beyond, might error? It's fine generally.\n\nFor particles I'll use a pre-rendered dot sprite.\n\nLet me write the scene functions with explicit coordinates. Keep them clean.\n\nI'll now produce the code.\n\nScene 1 detail coordinates:\n- window frame: (150,150)-(690,660)\n- moon: center (400,270) r=54\n- city: rects from x=150..690 at y=520..660\n- stars: random dots seeded\n- laptop screen: outer (700,330)-(1290,830) ; inner (716,346)-(1274,814)\n- laptop base: polygon (660,830),(1330,830),(1390,890),(600,890)\n- desk: (0,890)-(1920,930)\n- code lines inside inner screen\n- clock top-right: "02:00" at (1700, 120) big serif with blinking colon — but overlaps chapter? Put clock inside window area or at (1620,150) right aligned.\n- title chip top-left: "01 / 10" and title "夜 · 提交之前"\n\nHmm top-left title and clock at top-right - fine.\n\nLet me define a common header function:\n```python\ndef header(img, idx, total, label, t):\n    # left: accent line + "场景 0X / 10"\n    # right: label\n```\nPut at y=90.\n\nAnd bottom progress bar at y=1042.\n\nContent region: y 180..1000. So scene elements should live in 200..1000.\n\nLet me adjust scene 1: window (150,230)-(700,700), laptop screen (740,300)-(1330,780), base y 780..840, desk 840..870. Clock at (1750,150) anchor rt.\n\nOK good enough. Since I can't see, I'll verify with OCR + pixel stats and adjust if needed.\n\nLet me write the code.\n\nFor scene 2 browser: (240,230)-(1680,880).\nHeader inside: y 230..300 with dots and URL.\nBanner: (280,330)-(1640,440).\nRepo rows: y 480, 550, 620, 690, 760 each row height 60.\n\nScene 3 cards: three cards each w=470 h=300 at y=430, x=230, 725, 1220.\nTitle text above: y=300.\nCaption below: y=800.\n\nScene 4: node circle at (380,560) r=90; cards at (900,400)-(1560,540) and (900,640)-(1560,780).\nWait cards need x from 900 to 1560 → inside bounds.\n\nScene 5: panel (300,240)-(1620,860); rows at y=340,460,580,700; verdict stamp near (1300,760).\n\nScene 6: browser (240,200)-(1680,900); URL bar (300,250)-(1620,320); form fields at y 380,480,580; dropdown at 700.\n\nScene 7: compose panel (260,230)-(1400,880); side notes at x=1450..1800.\n\nScene 8: timeline y=560, from x=300 to x=1620, 3 nodes.\n\nScene 9: email card (300,300)-(1620,820); status chip top right (1300,220)-(1650,290).\n\nScene 10: centered big text.\n\nOK writing now. This is long; let me just do it.\n\nFor safety, wrap each scene draw in try/except so a failure doesn't kill the whole render? No — better to fail loudly during testing. I'll test render a few sample frames first, then run full render in background.\n\nLet me write render.py with a --test mode that renders sample frames for given scene indices and times.\n\nLet me go.🔧 调用工具: create_file\n参数: {"content": "# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\\n\\"\\"\\"GitHub 解封教程 · 1080p60 剧情动画渲染器\\"\\"\\"\\nimport os, sys, json, math, random, subprocess\\nimport numpy as np\\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw, ImageFont, ImageFilter\\n\\nBASE = \\"/data/data/com.termux/files/home/vt\\"\\nW, H = 1920, 1080\\nFPS = 60\\nLEAD_IN = 1.6\\nSCENE_GAP = 0.70\\nTAIL = 3.0\\nFADE = 0.40\\n\\nSANS = \\"/system/fonts/NotoSansCJK-Regular.ttc\\"\\nSERIF = \\"/system/fonts/NotoSerifCJK-Regular.ttc\\"\\nMONO = \\"/system/fonts/DroidSansMono.ttf\\"\\n\\nC_TXT = (231, 238, 247)\\nC_MUT = (139, 157, 185)\\nC_DIM = (92, 108, 133)\\nC_BLUE = (88, 166, 255)\\nC_GRN = (63, 185, 80)\\nC_RED = (248, 81, 73)\\nC_AMB = (240, 180, 41)\\nC_BG1 = (7, 10, 18)\\nC_BG2 = (17, 25, 41)\\nC_CARD = (17, 25, 41)\\nC_CARD2 = (23, 33, 52)\\nC_BORD = (48, 64, 92)\\n\\n_fonts = {}\\n_cache = {}\\n\\n\\ndef font(key, size, bold=False):\\n    k = (key, size)\\n    if k not in _fonts:\\n        if key == \\"serif\\":\\n            _fonts[k] = ImageFont.truetype(SERIF, size, index=2)\\n        elif key == \\"mono\\":\\n            _fonts[k] = ImageFont.truetype(MONO, size)\\n        else:\\n            _fonts[k] = ImageFont.truetype(SANS, size, index=2)\\n    return _fonts[k]\\n\\n\\ndef sprite(text, fkey, size, color, bold=False, outline=None):\\n    k = (\\"s\\", text, fkey, size, color, bold, outline)\\n    s = _cache.get(k)\\n    if s is None:\\n        f = font(fkey, size)\\n        sw = 2 if bold else 0\\n        of = outline if outline else (color if bold else None)\\n        tmp = ImageDraw.Draw(Image.new(\\"RGBA\\", (8, 8)))\\n        bb = tmp.textbbox((0, 0), text, font=f, stroke_width=sw)\\n        w = max(4, bb[2] - bb[0] + 8 + sw * 2)\\n        h = max(4, bb[3] - bb[1] + 8 + sw * 2)\\n        s = Image.new(\\"RGBA\\", (w, h), (0, 0, 0, 0))\\n        d = ImageDraw.Draw(s)\\n        d.text((4 + sw - bb[0], 4 + sw - bb[1]), text, font=f,\\n               fill=color + (255,), stroke_width=sw,\\n               stroke_fill=(of + (255,)) if of else None)\\n        _cache[k] = s\\n    return s\\n\\n\\ndef blit(img, x, y, s, alpha=1.0, anchor=\\"lt\\", rot=0):\\n    if alpha <= 0.004:\\n        return\\n    if rot:\\n        s = s.rotate(rot, resample=Image.BICUBIC, expand=True)\\n    w, h = s.size\\n    if anchor == \\"ct\\":\\n        x -= w // 2\\n    elif anchor == \\"rt\\":\\n        x -= w\\n    elif anchor == \\"cm\\":\\n        x -= w // 2\\n        y -= h // 2\\n    elif anchor == \\"cb\\":\\n        x -= w // 2\\n        y -= h\\n    elif anchor == \\"rm\\":\\n        x -= w\\n        y -= h // 2\\n    x, y = int(x), int(y)\\n    if alpha >= 0.995:\\n        img.paste(s, (x, y), s)\\n    else:\\n        a = s.getchannel(\\"A\\").point(lambda v: int(v * alpha))\\n        img.paste(s, (x, y), a)\\n\\n\\ndef text(img, x, y, s, fkey=\\"sans\\", size=34, color=C_TXT, alpha=1.0,\\n         anchor=\\"lt\\", bold=False, outline=None, rot=0):\\n    blit(img, x, y, sprite(s, fkey, size, color, bold, outline), alpha, anchor, rot)\\n\\n\\ndef tw(s, fkey=\\"sans\\", size=34, bold=False):\\n    return sprite(s, fkey, size, (0, 0, 0), bold).size[0] - 8\\n\\n\\ndef clamp01(v):\\n    return 0.0 if v < 0 else (1.0 if v > 1 else v)\\n\\n\\ndef eo(v):  # ease out cubic\\n    v = clamp01(v)\\n    return 1 - (1 - v) ** 3\\n\\n\\ndef eob(v):  # ease out back\\n    v = clamp01(v)\\n    c = 1.70158\\n    return 1 + (c + 1) * (v - 1) ** 3 + c * (v - 1) ** 2\\n\\n\\ndef ei(v):\\n    v = clamp01(v)\\n    return v * v\\n\\n\\ndef stage(t, start, dur):\\n    return clamp01((t - start) / max(0.001, dur))\\n\\n\\n# ---------------- 背景 ----------------\\ndef make_base():\\n    k = \\"base\\"\\n    if k in _cache:\\n        return _cache[k]\\n    y = np.linspace(0, 1, H)[:, None, None]\\n    top = np.array(C_BG1, dtype=np.float32)\\n    bot = np.array(C_BG2, dtype=np.float32)\\n    grad = top + (bot - top) * (y ** 0.85)\\n    arr = np.repeat(grad, W, axis=1).astype(np.uint8)\\n    img = Image.fromarray(arr, \\"RGB\\")\\n\\n    # 细网格\\n    ov = Image.new(\\"RGBA\\", (W, H), (0, 0, 0, 0))\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(ov)\\n    for gx in range(0, W, 120):\\n        d.line([(gx, 0), (gx, H)], fill=(120, 165, 235, 9), width=1)\\n    for gy in range(0, H, 120):\\n        d.line([(0, gy), (W, gy)], fill=(120, 165, 235, 9), width=1)\\n    img = Image.alpha_composite(img.convert(\\"RGBA\\"), ov).convert(\\"RGB\\")\\n\\n    # 暗角\\n    vy, vx = np.mgrid[0:H, 0:W]\\n    cx, cy = W / 2, H / 2\\n    r = np.sqrt(((vx - cx) / (W * 0.62)) ** 2 + ((vy - cy) / (H * 0.62)) ** 2)\\n    vig = np.clip(1.0 - 0.42 * np.clip((r - 0.45) / 0.9, 0, 1) ** 1.4, 0, 1)\\n    arr = (np.asarray(img, dtype=np.float32) * vig[:, :, None]).astype(np.uint8)\\n    img = Image.fromarray(arr, \\"RGB\\")\\n    _cache[k] = img\\n    return img\\n\\n\\ndef blob(color, size, strength=46):\\n    k = (\\"blob\\", color, size, strength)\\n    if k in _cache:\\n        return _cache[k]\\n    n = size\\n    yy, xx = np.mgrid[0:n, 0:n]\\n    r = np.sqrt((xx - n / 2) ** 2 + (yy - n / 2) ** 2) / (n / 2)\\n    a = np.clip(1 - r, 0, 1) ** 2.2 * strength\\n    arr = np.zeros((n, n, 4), dtype=np.uint8)\\n    arr[:, :, 0] = color[0]\\n    arr[:, :, 1] = color[1]\\n    arr[:, :, 2] = color[2]\\n    arr[:, :, 3] = a.astype(np.uint8)\\n    s = Image.fromarray(arr, \\"RGBA\\")\\n    _cache[k] = s\\n    return s\\n\\n\\ndef dot(size, color):\\n    k = (\\"dot\\", size, color)\\n    if k in _cache:\\n        return _cache[k]\\n    yy, xx = np.mgrid[0:size, 0:size]\\n    r = np.sqrt((xx - size / 2) ** 2 + (yy - size / 2) ** 2) / (size / 2)\\n    a = np.clip(1 - r, 0, 1) ** 1.6 * 255\\n    arr = np.zeros((size, size, 4), dtype=np.uint8)\\n    arr[:, :, 0] = color[0]\\n    arr[:, :, 1] = color[1]\\n    arr[:, :, 2] = color[2]\\n    arr[:, :, 3] = a.astype(np.uint8)\\n    s = Image.fromarray(arr, \\"RGBA\\")\\n    _cache[k] = s\\n    return s\\n\\n\\nPART = []\\nrandom.seed(20261)\\nfor i in range(46):\\n    PART.append(dict(x=random.uniform(0, W), y=random.uniform(0, H),\\n                     r=random.choice([5, 7, 9, 12, 16]),\\n                     sp=random.uniform(8, 26), ph=random.uniform(0, 6.28),\\n                     c=random.choice([C_BLUE, C_BLUE, (120, 200, 220), C_AMB])))\\n\\n\\ndef draw_bg(img, t, accent=C_BLUE, glowp=1.0):\\n    b = blob(accent, 860, int(50 * glowp))\\n    ax = 420 + 300 * math.sin(t * 0.16)\\n    ay = 300 + 120 * math.cos(t * 0.21)\\n    blit(img, ax - 430, ay - 430, b, 1.0)\\n    b2 = blob((34, 84, 130), 980, 44)\\n    bx = 1500 + 260 * math.cos(t * 0.13 + 1.4)\\n    by = 780 + 120 * math.sin(t * 0.17 + 0.6)\\n    blit(img, bx - 490, by - 490, b2, 1.0)\\n\\n    for p in PART:\\n        yy = (p[\\"y\\"] - t * p[\\"sp\\"]) % (H + 160) - 80\\n        xx = p[\\"x\\"] + 26 * math.sin(t * 0.5 + p[\\"ph\\"])\\n        a = 0.30 + 0.22 * math.sin(t * 0.9 + p[\\"ph\\"])\\n        blit(img, xx, yy, dot(p[\\"r\\"], p[\\"c\\"]), clamp01(a))\\n\\n\\n# ---------------- 通用组件 ----------------\\ndef panel(img, box, r=22, fill=C_CARD, border=C_BORD, bw=2, shadow=True):\\n    x0, y0, x1, y1 = box\\n    if shadow:\\n        k = (\\"ps\\", box, r)\\n        sh = _cache.get(k)\\n        if sh is None:\\n            m = 70\\n            sh = Image.new(\\"RGBA\\", (x1 - x0 + m * 2, y1 - y0 + m * 2), (0, 0, 0, 0))\\n            d = ImageDraw.Draw(sh)\\n            d.rounded_rectangle([m, m + 14, m + (x1 - x0), m + 14 + (y1 - y0)],\\n                                radius=r, fill=(0, 0, 0, 130))\\n            sh = sh.filter(ImageFilter.GaussianBlur(16))\\n            _cache[k] = sh\\n        img.paste(sh, (x0 - 70, y0 - 70), sh)\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n    d.rounded_rectangle(box, radius=r, fill=fill, outline=border, width=bw)\\n\\n\\ndef bar(img, box, p, color=C_GRN, r=6):\\n    x0, y0, x1, y1 = box\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n    d.rounded_rectangle(box, radius=r, fill=(30, 40, 58))\\n    w = (x1 - x0) * clamp01(p)\\n    if w > 4:\\n        d.rounded_rectangle([x0, y0, x0 + w, y1], radius=r, fill=color)\\n\\n\\ndef circle(img, cx, cy, rad, fill=None, outline=None, width=3):\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n    d.ellipse([cx - rad, cy - rad, cx + rad, cy + rad], fill=fill,\\n              outline=outline, width=width)\\n\\n\\ndef check(img, cx, cy, p, color=C_GRN, lw=7, scale=1.0):\\n    if p <= 0:\\n        return\\n    pts = [(-0.45, 0.02), (-0.12, 0.36), (0.48, -0.34)]\\n    pts = [(cx + a * 46 * scale, cy + b * 46 * scale) for a, b in pts]\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n    n = clamp01(p)\\n    if n <= 0.45:\\n        q = n / 0.45\\n        d.line([pts[0], (pts[0][0] + (pts[1][0] - pts[0][0]) * q,\\n                         pts[0][1] + (pts[1][1] - pts[0][1]) * q)],\\n               fill=color, width=lw, joint=\\"curve\\")\\n    else:\\n        q = (n - 0.45) / 0.55\\n        d.line([pts[0], pts[1]], fill=color, width=lw, joint=\\"curve\\")\\n        d.line([pts[1], (pts[1][0] + (pts[2][0] - pts[1][0]) * q,\\n                         pts[1][1] + (pts[2][1] - pts[1][1]) * q)],\\n               fill=color, width=lw, joint=\\"curve\\")\\n\\n\\ndef cross(img, cx, cy, p, color=C_RED, lw=7):\\n    if p <= 0:\\n        return\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n    L = 26\\n    n = clamp01(p)\\n    if n <= 0.5:\\n        q = n / 0.5\\n        d.line([(cx - L, cy - L), (cx - L + 2 * L * q, cy - L + 2 * L * q)],\\n               fill=color, width=lw)\\n    else:\\n        q = (n - 0.5) / 0.5\\n        d.line([(cx - L, cy - L), (cx + L, cy + L)], fill=color, width=lw)\\n        d.line([(cx + L, cy - L), (cx + L - 2 * L * q, cy - L + 2 * L * q)],\\n               fill=color, width=lw)\\n\\n\\ndef bez(p0, p1, p2, n=60):\\n    out = []\\n    for i in range(n + 1):\\n        u = i / n\\n        x = (1 - u) ** 2 * p0[0] + 2 * (1 - u) * u * p1[0] + u * u * p2[0]\\n        y = (1 - u) ** 2 * p0[1] + 2 * (1 - u) * u * p1[1] + u * u * p2[1]\\n        out.append((x, y))\\n    return out\\n\\n\\ndef draw_bez(img, p0, p1, p2, prog, color, lw=4):\\n    pts = bez(p0, p1, p2)\\n    n = int(len(pts) * clamp01(prog))\\n    if n > 1:\\n        ImageDraw.Draw(img).line(pts[:n], fill=color, width=lw, joint=\\"curve\\")\\n\\n\\ndef header(img, idx, total, label, t):\\n    a = eo(t / 0.5)\\n    text(img, 110, 74, \\"%02d\\" % idx, \\"serif\\", 40, C_BLUE, a, bold=True)\\n    text(img, 168, 84, \\"/ %02d\\" % total, \\"sans\\", 24, C_DIM, a)\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n    d.line([(110, 132), (110 + 70 * a, 132)], fill=C_BLUE, width=3)\\n    text(img, 110, 146, label, \\"serif\\", 34, C_TXT, eo((t - 0.15) / 0.6))\\n    text(img, W - 110, 92, \\"GITHUB 账号解封 · 实操指南\\", \\"sans\\", 24, C_DIM,\\n         a, anchor=\\"rt\\")\\n\\n\\ndef footer(img, t, dur):\\n    p = clamp01(t / max(0.1, dur))\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n    d.line([(110, 1026), (W - 110, 1026)], fill=(34, 46, 66), width=2)\\n    d.line([(110, 1026), (110 + (W - 220) * p, 1026)], fill=(70, 130, 200), width=3)\\n    hx = 110 + (W - 220) * p\\n    blit(img, hx - 13, 1013, dot(26, C_BLUE), 0.9)\\n\\n\\n# ---------------- 场景 ----------------\\ndef s01(img, t, dur):\\n    \\"\\"\\"夜 · 提交之前\\"\\"\\"\\n    a = eo(t / 0.6)\\n    # 窗\\n    panel(img, (150, 250, 700, 760), 10, (11, 17, 29), (40, 56, 82), 2, False)\\n    blit(img, 380, 250, dot(300, (150, 180, 220)), 0.20 * a)\\n    circle(img, 420, 380, 52, (226, 232, 244))\\n    circle(img, 400, 366, 12, (208, 216, 232))\\n    circle(img, 440, 398, 8, (210, 218, 234))\\n    # 星空 + 城市\\n    random.seed(7)\\n    for i in range(26):\\n        sx = random.randint(170, 680)\\n        sy = random.randint(265, 470)\\n        sp = 0.34 + 0.32 * math.sin(t * 2.2 + i)\\n        circle(img, sx, sy, 2, (200, 214, 235)) if sp > 0.4 else None\\n    for i, (bx, bw, bh) in enumerate([(170, 70, 120), (250, 54, 170), (315, 82, 96),\\n                                     (410, 60, 140), (480, 76, 108), (565, 58, 186),\\n                                     (630, 60, 126)]):\\n        top = 700 - bh\\n        d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n        d.rectangle([bx, top, bx + bw, 760], fill=(16, 24, 40))\\n        for wy in range(top + 12, 750, 26):\\n            for wx in range(bx + 10, bx + bw - 10, 20):\\n                if (wx * wy + i) % 5 < 2:\\n                    lit = 0.5 + 0.5 * math.sin(t * 1.6 + wx * 0.1)\\n                    d.rectangle([wx, wy, wx + 8, wy + 12],\\n                                fill=(int(150 * lit), int(170 * lit), int(120 + 60 * lit)))\\n    # 桌面\\n    ImageDraw.Draw(img).rectangle([0, 900, W, 940], fill=(20, 27, 42))\\n\\n    # 笔记本\\n    sc = (760, 320, 1330, 800)\\n    blit(img, 1045, 560, blob(C_BLUE, 700, 40), 0.9 * a)\\n    panel(img, sc, 14, (10, 14, 24), (62, 84, 116), 3, False)\\n    inner = (778, 338, 1312, 782)\\n    ImageDraw.Draw(img).rectangle(inner, fill=(13, 18, 30))\\n    # 代码行\\n    ys = 372\\n    rows = [(0.5, C_BLUE), (0.72, (150, 170, 200)), (0.34, C_AMB),\\n            (0.62, (120, 200, 160)), (0.45, (150, 170, 200)), (0.8, C_BLUE),\\n            (0.28, (200, 160, 220)), (0.55, (150, 170, 200))]\\n    tp = clamp01((t - 1.2) / 3.2)\\n    for i, (f, c) in enumerate(rows):\\n        seg = clamp01((tp - i * 0.10) / 0.22)\\n        if seg <= 0:\\n            continue\\n        y = ys + i * 46\\n        d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n        d.rectangle([796, y, 796 + 16, y + 18], fill=(70, 90, 120))\\n        wid = int((1100 - 820) * f * seg)\\n        if seg > 0.05:\\n            d.rectangle([826, y, 826 + max(4, wid), y + 18], fill=c)\\n    # 光标\\n    if tp > 0.98 and (t * 2 % 1) < 0.55:\\n        ImageDraw.Draw(img).rectangle([824 + 300, ys + 7 * 46, 830 + 300, ys + 7 * 46 + 22],\\n                                      fill=C_TXT)\\n    # 键盘\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n    d.polygon([(690, 800), (1400, 800), (1470, 878), (620, 878)], fill=(28, 38, 56))\\n    d.polygon([(690, 800), (1400, 800), (1470, 878), (620, 878)],\\n              outline=(58, 76, 104))\\n    for i in range(9):\\n        x0 = 700 + i * 78\\n        d.line([(x0, 812), (x0 - 40, 866)], fill=(44, 58, 82), width=2)\\n\\n    # 时钟\\n    blink = \\":\\" if (t * 1.6 % 1) < 0.6 else \\" \\"\\n    text(img, 1760, 240, \\"02%s00\\" % blink, \\"serif\\", 76, C_TXT, 0.55 * a, anchor=\\"rt\\", bold=True)\\n    text(img, 1760, 336, \\"AM · 截止前 6 小时\\", \\"sans\\", 26, C_MUT, 0.6 * a, anchor=\\"rt\\")\\n\\n    # 字幕条\\n    sub = \\"登录 GitHub，准备提交毕业设计\\"\\n    al = eo((t - 2.6) / 0.7) * (1 - eo((t - dur + 0.7) / 0.6))\\n    if al > 0.01:\\n        panel(img, (560, 950, 1370, 1012), 16, (14, 20, 34), (44, 60, 88), 1, False)\\n        blit(img, 610, 981, dot(12, C_BLUE), al)\\n        text(img, 640, 981, sub, \\"sans\\", 30, C_TXT, al, anchor=\\"lm\\")\\n\\n\\ndef s02(img, t, dur):\\n    \\"\\"\\"封禁提示\\"\\"\\"\\n    a = eo(t / 0.5)\\n    shake = 0.0\\n    if t < 0.9:\\n        shake = math.sin(t * 46) * 16 * (1 - t / 0.9)\\n    ox = int(shake)\\n    bx = (250 + ox, 210, 1670 + ox, 890)\\n    panel(img, bx, 16, (12, 17, 28), (46, 62, 90), 2)\\n    # 浏览器栏\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n    d.rounded_rectangle([bx[0], 210, bx[2], 282], radius=16, fill=(20, 28, 44))\\n    for i, c in enumerate([(255, 95, 86), (255, 189, 46), (39, 201, 63)]):\\n        circle(img, bx[0] + 34 + i * 28, 246, 9, c)\\n    d.rounded_rectangle([bx[0] + 140, 228, bx[2] - 30, 268], radius=20, fill=(12, 18, 30))\\n    text(img, bx[0] + 164, 248, \\"github.com/settings/profile\\", \\"mono\\", 24, C_MUT, a, anchor=\\"lm\\")\\n\\n    # 红色横幅下坠\\n    bp = eob((t - 0.35) / 0.65)\\n    by = 316 + (1 - bp) * -110\\n    ba = clamp01((t - 0.3) / 0.5)\\n    banner = (290 + ox, by, 1630 + ox, by + 116)\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n    d.rounded_rectangle(banner, radius=10, fill=(58, 20, 26), outline=(190, 62, 58), width=3)\\n    blit(img, banner[0] + 46, by + 58, dot(26, C_RED), ba)\\n    text(img, banner[0] + 86, by + 34, \\"Your account has been suspended\\",\\n         \\"mono\\", 40, (255, 214, 210), ba, bold=False)\\n    text(img, banner[0] + 86, by + 84, \\"您的账号已被停用 · 违反《可接受使用政策》\\",\\n         \\"sans\\", 26, (240, 170, 165), ba * 0.9)\\n\\n    # 仓库行塌陷成灰\\n    rows = [(\\"CaoXiangWang/dotfiles\\", \\"Updated 2 days ago · 1.2k ★\\"),\\n            (\\"CaoXiangWang/study-notes\\", \\"Updated 5 days ago · 320 ★\\"),\\n            (\\"CaoXiangWang/thesis-2026\\", \\"Updated 1 day ago · 84 ★\\"),\\n            (\\"CaoXiangWang/harness\\", \\"Updated 3 hours ago · 2.1k ★\\")]\\n    for i, (nm, meta) in enumerate(rows):\\n        gp = clamp01((t - 1.0 - i * 0.32) / 0.7)\\n        y = 470 + i * 96\\n        d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n        col = (int(200 - 110 * gp), int(210 - 120 * gp), int(228 - 110 * gp))\\n        d.rounded_rectangle([320 + ox, y, 1600 + ox, y + 74], radius=8,\\n                            fill=(17, 23, 36), outline=(40, 52, 74))\\n        text(img, 344 + ox, y + 20, nm, \\"mono\\", 30, col)\\n        text(img, 344 + ox, y + 52, meta, \\"sans\\", 20, (int(120 - 60 * gp),) * 3)\\n        if gp > 0.9:\\n            text(img, 1500 + ox, y + 26, \\"UNAVAILABLE\\", \\"mono\\", 22, (150, 70, 70), 1, anchor=\\"rt\\")\\n\\n    # 翻译字幕\\n    al = eo((t - 2.2) / 0.8)\\n    if al > 0.01:\\n        text(img, 960, 950, \\"三年积累，一瞬间全部变灰\\", \\"serif\\", 44, (240, 200, 196),\\n             al, anchor=\\"ct\\", bold=True)\\n\\n\\ndef s03(img, t, dur):\\n    \\"\\"\\"慌乱 · 三个错误动作\\"\\"\\"\\n    items = [(\\"注册小号\\", \\"换个身份继续用\\", \\"违反一人一号\\"),\\n             (\\"切换网络\\", \\"挂代理换 IP\\", \\"风控评分上升\\"),\\n             (\\"狂发邮件\\", \\"一小时十几封\\", \\"被判骚扰冻结\\")]\\n    for i, (t1, t2, t3) in enumerate(items):\\n        st = 0.5 + i * 0.85\\n        p = eob((t - st) / 0.55)\\n        if p <= 0:\\n            continue\\n        al = clamp01((t - st) / 0.45)\\n        x0 = 210 + i * 500\\n        y0 = 420\\n        dy = (1 - p) * 60\\n        panel(img, (x0, y0 + dy, x0 + 460, y0 + 330 + dy), 20,\\n              (26, 20, 30), (120, 60, 66), 2)\\n        text(img, x0 + 230, y0 + 70 + dy, t1, \\"serif\\", 44, C_TXT, al, anchor=\\"ct\\", bold=True)\\n        text(img, x0 + 230, y0 + 146 + dy, t2, \\"sans\\", 27, C_MUT, al, anchor=\\"ct\\")\\n        text(img, x0 + 230, y0 + 196 + dy, t3, \\"sans\\", 24, (230, 130, 125), al, anchor=\\"ct\\")\\n        # 红叉\\n        xp = clamp01((t - st - 0.5) / 0.4)\\n        if xp > 0:\\n            circle(img, x0 + 230, y0 + 268 + dy, 34, None, (150, 60, 62), 3)\\n            cross(img, x0 + 230, y0 + 268 + dy, xp, C_RED, 7)\\n\\n    al = eo((t - 3.4) / 0.8)\\n    if al > 0.01:\\n        text(img, W // 2, 990, \\"这三个动作，会让风控评分更高\\", \\"serif\\", 40,\\n             (232, 150, 146), al, anchor=\\"ct\\", bold=True)\\n    # 边缘红脉冲\\n    pz = 0.5 + 0.5 * math.sin(t * 3.4)\\n    if t > 0.6:\\n        ov = Image.new(\\"RGBA\\", (W, H), (0, 0, 0, 0))\\n        d = ImageDraw.Draw(ov)\\n        for i in range(9):\\n            al2 = int(20 * pz * (1 - i / 9))\\n            d.rectangle([i * 7, i * 7, W - i * 7, H - i * 7], outline=(220, 60, 60, al2), width=8)\\n        img.paste(ov, (0, 0), ov)\\n\\n\\ndef s04(img, t, dur):\\n    \\"\\"\\"冷静 · 分类\\"\\"\\"\\n    # 起点节点\\n    p0 = eob((t - 0.4) / 0.6)\\n    if p0 > 0:\\n        blit(img, 300, 470, dot(240, C_BLUE), 0.28 * p0)\\n        circle(img, 300, 470, int(86 * p0), (18, 28, 45), C_BLUE, 3)\\n        text(img, 300, 470, \\"封禁\\", \\"serif\\", 34, C_TXT, p0, anchor=\\"cm\\", bold=True)\\n\\n    # 两条分叉\\n    lp = clamp01((t - 1.0) / 0.9)\\n    draw_bez(img, (392, 440), (620, 380), (860, 350), lp, C_GRN, 5)\\n    draw_bez(img, (392, 500), (620, 590), (860, 620), lp, C_RED, 5)\\n\\n    # 上方绿卡\\n    gp = clamp01((t - 1.7) / 0.5)\\n    al = gp\\n    if gp > 0:\\n        dy = int((1 - gp) * 24)\\n        panel(img, (880, 250 + dy, 1620, 470 + dy), 18, (16, 32, 26), (52, 130, 80), 2)\\n        text(img, 920, 288 + dy, \\"A 类 · 自动风控误判\\", \\"serif\\", 40, C_GRN, al, bold=True)\\n        text(img, 920, 352 + dy, \\"垃圾信息检测把你误标成 spam 账号\\", \\"sans\\", 28, C_TXT, al)\\n        text(img, 920, 402 + dy, \\"→ 可申诉，成功率高\\", \\"sans\\", 28, (120, 210, 140), al)\\n\\n    # 下方红卡\\n    rp = clamp01((t - 2.5) / 0.5)\\n    if rp > 0:\\n        dy = int((1 - rp) * 24)\\n        panel(img, (880, 540 + dy, 1620, 760 + dy), 18, (32, 20, 22), (150, 66, 62), 2)\\n        text(img, 920, 578 + dy, \\"B 类 · 真实违规\\", \\"serif\\", 40, C_RED, rp, bold=True)\\n        text(img, 920, 642 + dy, \\"盗版、攻击工具、刷量、滥用接口\\", \\"sans\\", 28, C_TXT, rp)\\n        text(img, 920, 692 + dy, \\"→ 申诉基本无效\\", \\"sans\\", 28, (220, 130, 126), rp)\\n\\n\\ndef s05(img, t, dur):\\n    \\"\\"\\"自查 · 你是哪一种\\"\\"\\"\\n    panel(img, (250, 240, 1670, 880), 20, (15, 22, 36), (46, 62, 90), 2)\\n    text(img, 300, 276, \\"自查清单 · 六项都干净才算误判\\", \\"serif\\", 40, C_TXT,\\n         eo(t / 0.6), bold=True)\\n    rows = [\\"没有刷星、刷关注、刷 fork\\", \\"没有上传盗版或破解资源\\",\\n            \\"没有批量注册、批量操作\\", \\"没有滥用 API、爬取数据\\"]\\n    for i, r in enumerate(rows):\\n        y = 400 + i * 104\\n        st = 0.7 + i * 0.75\\n        al = clamp01((t - st) / 0.4)\\n        if al <= 0:\\n            continue\\n        d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n        d.rounded_rectangle([300, y, 1620, y + 82], radius=10,\\n                            fill=(19, 27, 43), outline=(42, 58, 84))\\n        circle(img, 356, y + 41, 24, None, (60, 78, 106), 3)\\n        check(img, 356, y + 41, clamp01((t - st - 0.25) / 0.45), C_GRN)\\n        text(img, 404, y + 41, r, \\"sans\\", 32, C_TXT, al, anchor=\\"lm\\")\\n\\n    # 判定印章\\n    sp = clamp01((t - 4.2) / 0.5)\\n    if sp > 0:\\n        sc = 0.85 + 0.15 * eob(sp)\\n        s = sprite(\\"判定：SPAM 误报\\", \\"serif\\", 46, C_GRN, True)\\n        s = s.resize((int(s.width * sc), int(s.height * sc)))\\n        blit(img, 1180, 770, s, sp, anchor=\\"cm\\", rot=4)\\n        d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n        d.rounded_rectangle([1140, 726, 1560, 818], radius=10,\\n                            outline=(70, 150, 95), width=3)\\n\\n\\ndef s06(img, t, dur):\\n    \\"\\"\\"入口 · 正确的位置\\"\\"\\"\\n    panel(img, (230, 200, 1690, 920), 16, (12, 17, 28), (46, 62, 90), 2)\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n    d.rounded_rectangle([230, 200, 1690, 286], radius=16, fill=(20, 28, 44))\\n    for i, c in enumerate([(255, 95, 86), (255, 189, 46), (39, 201, 63)]):\\n        circle(img, 266 + i * 28, 243, 9, c)\\n    # 地址栏打字\\n    url = \\"support.github.com/contact\\"\\n    n = int(len(url) * clamp01((t - 0.5) / 1.5))\\n    d.rounded_rectangle([340, 222, 1660, 266], radius=22, fill=(10, 15, 26))\\n    text(img, 366, 244, url[:n], \\"mono\\", 26, C_BLUE if n > 0 else C_DIM, 1, anchor=\\"lm\\")\\n    if n > 0 and (t * 2 % 1) < 0.6:\\n        cx = 366 + tw(url[:n], \\"mono\\", 26) + 2\\n        d.rectangle([cx, 232, cx + 3, 258], fill=C_TXT)\\n\\n    # 分类下拉\\n    dp = clamp01((t - 2.0) / 0.5)\\n    if dp > 0:\\n        text(img, 300, 330, \\"选择问题类型\\", \\"sans\\", 26, C_MUT, dp)\\n        panel(img, (300, 372, 1620, 452), 10, (19, 27, 43), (58, 78, 108), 2, False)\\n        text(img, 330, 412, \\"Account Suspension  /  Appeal  ▾\\", \\"mono\\", 30,\\n             C_TXT, dp, anchor=\\"lm\\")\\n        if dp > 0.9:\\n            panel(img, (300, 460, 1000, 660), 10, (24, 34, 52), (70, 120, 180), 2)\\n            for i, o in enumerate([\\"Account Suspension / Appeal\\", \\"Report Abuse\\",\\n                                   \\"Billing\\", \\"Other\\"]):\\n                y = 486 + i * 44\\n                hl = (i == 0)\\n                if hl:\\n                    ImageDraw.Draw(img).rounded_rectangle(\\n                        [306, y - 6, 994, y + 38], radius=6, fill=(31, 60, 96))\\n                text(img, 330, y + 6, o, \\"mono\\", 24,\\n                     C_BLUE if hl else C_MUT)\\n\\n    # 表单三项\\n    fields = [(\\"Username\\", \\"CaoXiangWang\\"), (\\"Email\\", \\"caoxiang@mail.com\\"),\\n              (\\"Reason\\", \\"Account suspended by mistake, please review\\")]\\n    for i, (lb, vl) in enumerate(fields):\\n        st = 3.0 + i * 0.85\\n        al = clamp01((t - st) / 0.4)\\n        if al <= 0:\\n            continue\\n        y = 690 + i * 74\\n        text(img, 300, y - 4, lb, \\"sans\\", 22, C_MUT, al)\\n        panel(img, (470, y - 12, 1620, y + 44), 8, (18, 26, 41), (44, 60, 86), 1, False)\\n        n2 = int(len(vl) * clamp01((t - st - 0.15) / 0.7))\\n        text(img, 496, y + 16, vl[:n2], \\"mono\\", 26, C_TXT, al, anchor=\\"lm\\")\\n\\n\\ndef s07(img, t, dur):\\n    \\"\\"\\"话术 · 只讲事实\\"\\"\\"\\n    panel(img, (240, 230, 1400, 890), 16, (14, 20, 33), (46, 62, 90), 2)\\n    text(img, 280, 262, \\"Re: Account Suspension Appeal\\", \\"mono\\", 30, C_BLUE,\\n         eo(t / 0.5))\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n    d.line([(270, 312), (1370, 312)], fill=(44, 58, 82), width=2)\\n    text(img, 280, 336, \\"To: support@github.com\\", \\"mono\\", 24, C_MUT, eo((t - 0.3) / 0.4))\\n\\n    lines = [\\"Hello GitHub Support team,\\",\\n             \\"My account (CaoXiangWang) was suspended\\",\\n             \\"by your automated spam detection.\\",\\n             \\" \\",\\n             \\"I have reviewed my activity: no spam,\\",\\n             \\"no copyright violation, no automation.\\",\\n             \\" \\",\\n             \\"Could a human please review my account?\\"]\\n    for i, ln in enumerate(lines):\\n        st = 1.0 + i * 0.52\\n        al = clamp01((t - st) / 0.35)\\n        if al <= 0:\\n            continue\\n        y = 392 + i * 52\\n        n2 = int(len(ln) * clamp01((t - st) / 0.3))\\n        c = C_TXT if ln.strip() else C_DIM\\n        text(img, 280, y, ln[:n2], \\"mono\\", 27, c, al)\\n\\n    # 右侧注解\\n    notes = [(\\"✓\\", \\"我是谁\\", C_GRN, 2.4), (\\"✓\\", \\"我没有违规\\", C_GRN, 3.4),\\n             (\\"✗\\", \\"不要哀求\\", C_RED, 4.6), (\\"✗\\", \\"不要指责\\", C_RED, 5.4)]\\n    for sym, lb, c, st in notes:\\n        p = eob((t - st) / 0.45)\\n        if p <= 0:\\n            continue\\n        i2 = notes.index((sym, lb, c, st))\\n        y = 380 + i2 * 110\\n        dx = int((1 - p) * 40)\\n        panel(img, (1450 + dx, y, 1830 + dx, y + 84), 12, (18, 26, 42), c + (90,), 2, False)\\n        ImageDraw.Draw(img).rounded_rectangle([1450 + dx, y, 1830 + dx, y + 84],\\n                                             radius=12, outline=c, width=2)\\n        text(img, 1480 + dx, y + 42, sym, \\"sans\\", 34, c, p, anchor=\\"lm\\")\\n        text(img, 1530 + dx, y + 42, lb, \\"sans\\", 30, C_TXT, p, anchor=\\"lm\\")\\n\\n    al = eo((t - 6.4) / 0.7)\\n    if al > 0.01:\\n        text(img, 960, 990, \\"只讲事实：你是谁 · 你没违规 · 请人工复核\\", \\"serif\\", 38,\\n             C_AMB, al, anchor=\\"ct\\", bold=True)\\n\\n\\ndef s08(img, t, dur):\\n    \\"\\"\\"等待 · 别重复开单\\"\\"\\"\\n    panel(img, (230, 300, 1690, 780), 20, (14, 20, 33), (46, 62, 90), 2)\\n    text(img, 280, 340, \\"提交后的处理时间线\\", \\"serif\\", 38, C_TXT, eo(t / 0.6), bold=True)\\n\\n    y = 560\\n    x0, x1 = 340, 1580\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n    d.line([(x0, y), (x1, y)], fill=(40, 54, 78), width=4)\\n    p = clamp01((t - 0.8) / 5.0)\\n    if p > 0:\\n        d.line([(x0, y), (x0 + (x1 - x0) * p, y)], fill=C_BLUE, width=5)\\n        blit(img, x0 + (x1 - x0) * p - 14, y - 14, dot(28, C_BLUE), 1.0)\\n\\n    nodes = [(0.0, \\"提交工单\\", \\"记下工单号\\"), (0.5, \\"等待 1-3 天\\", \\"不要重复开单\\"),\\n             (1.0, \\"收到回复\\", \\"误判 → 解封\\")]\\n    for f, lb, sb in nodes:\\n        nx = x0 + (x1 - x0) * f\\n        ap = clamp01((p - f + 0.06) / 0.12) if f > 0 else 1.0\\n        circle(img, nx, y, 20, (16, 24, 38), C_BLUE if ap > 0.5 else (60, 78, 106), 4)\\n        if ap > 0.5:\\n            circle(img, nx, y, 9, C_BLUE)\\n        text(img, nx, y - 66, lb, \\"sans\\", 30, C_TXT if ap > 0.4 else C_DIM, 1, anchor=\\"cm\\")\\n        text(img, nx, y + 62, sb, \\"sans\\", 24, C_MUT, ap, anchor=\\"ct\\")\\n\\n    # 转圈等待\\n    if p > 0.35 and p < 0.95:\\n        ang = t * 260\\n        cx, cy = x0 + (x1 - x0) * 0.5, y - 150\\n        d.arc([cx - 26, cy - 26, cx + 26, cy + 26], ang, ang + 240, fill=C_AMB, width=6)\\n\\n    # 警示\\n    al = eo((t - 4.4) / 0.7)\\n    if al > 0.01:\\n        panel(img, (400, 640, 1520, 730), 12, (34, 26, 20), (150, 110, 50), 2, False)\\n        text(img, 470, 685, \\"⚠\\", \\"sans\\", 32, C_AMB, al, anchor=\\"lm\\")\\n        text(img, 520, 685, \\"重复开单 = 排队重新开始；频繁换 IP 登录 = 评分继续上升\\",\\n             \\"sans\\", 28, (238, 210, 160), al, anchor=\\"lm\\")\\n\\n\\ndef s09(img, t, dur):\\n    \\"\\"\\"结果 · 误判被纠正\\"\\"\\"\\n    # 状态标签翻转\\n    st = clamp01((t - 3.6) / 0.5)\\n    chip = (1380, 240, 1740, 320)\\n    panel(img, chip, 12, (40, 22, 24) if st < 0.5 else (18, 38, 26),\\n          (170, 70, 66) if st < 0.5 else (60, 150, 90), 2, False)\\n    if st < 0.5:\\n        text(img, 1420, 280, \\"Suspended\\", \\"mono\\", 28, C_RED, 1, anchor=\\"lm\\")\\n    else:\\n        text(img, 1420, 280, \\"Restored\\", \\"mono\\", 30, C_GRN, 1, anchor=\\"lm\\")\\n\\n    # 邮件卡\\n    ep = eob((t - 0.3) / 0.7)\\n    dx = int((1 - ep) * 90)\\n    box = (250 + dx, 350, 1670 + dx, 850)\\n    panel(img, box, 18, (15, 22, 36), (56, 132, 84), 3)\\n    blit(img, box[0] + 60, 402, dot(34, C_GRN), ep)\\n    text(img, box[0] + 52, 386, \\"GitHub Support\\", \\"serif\\", 40, C_TXT, ep, bold=True)\\n    text(img, box[0] + 52, 444, \\"support@github.com\\", \\"mono\\", 24, C_MUT, ep * 0.9)\\n    text(img, box[2] - 60, 400, \\"Oct 30 · 15:57 UTC\\", \\"mono\\", 22, C_DIM, ep, anchor=\\"rt\\")\\n\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n    d.line([(box[0] + 52, 490), (box[2] - 52, 490)], fill=(44, 60, 86), width=2)\\n\\n    body = [\\"Hi CaoXiangWang,\\",\\n            \\"Sometimes our spam detecting systems highlight accounts\\",\\n            \\"that need to be manually reviewed.\\",\\n            \\"\\",\\n            \\"I've reset your profile, so your repositories and gists\\",\\n            \\"should be available again.\\"]\\n    for i, ln in enumerate(body):\\n        st2 = 1.2 + i * 0.45\\n        al = clamp01((t - st2) / 0.35)\\n        if al <= 0:\\n            continue\\n        text(img, box[0] + 52, 522 + i * 46, ln, \\"mono\\", 27,\\n             C_TXT if i < 2 or i > 3 else C_DIM, al)\\n\\n    al = eo((t - 4.4) / 0.6)\\n    if al > 0.01:\\n        circle(img, box[0] + 74, 796, 20, (18, 40, 26), C_GRN, 2)\\n        check(img, box[0] + 74, 796, 1, C_GRN, 5, 0.55)\\n        text(img, box[0] + 110, 796, \\"仓库 · gist · 贡献记录 全部恢复\\", \\"sans\\", 30,\\n             (140, 220, 160), al, anchor=\\"lm\\")\\n\\n\\ndef s10(img, t, dur):\\n    \\"\\"\\"结论\\"\\"\\"\\n    l1 = eo((t - 0.4) / 0.7)\\n    l2 = eo((t - 1.3) / 0.7)\\n    text(img, W // 2, 400, \\"申诉不是求情\\", \\"serif\\", 96, C_TXT, l1, anchor=\\"ct\\", bold=True)\\n    text(img, W // 2, 540, \\"而是证明那台机器判错了\\", \\"serif\\", 76, C_BLUE, l2,\\n         anchor=\\"ct\\", bold=True)\\n    d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\n    gp = eo((t - 2.4) / 0.7)\\n    if gp > 0:\\n        d.line([(W // 2 - 300 * gp, 650), (W // 2 + 300 * gp, 650)], fill=C_BORD, width=2)\\n\\n    items = [\\"分清类型：误判还是真违规\\", \\"找对入口：support.github.com\\",\\n             \\"只讲事实：三句话说完\\"]\\n    for i, s in enumerate(items):\\n        al = eo((t - 3.0 - i * 0.6) / 0.6)\\n        if al <= 0:\\n            continue\\n        y = 720 + i * 74\\n        cx = W // 2 - 380\\n        circle(img, cx, y, 15, None, C_GRN, 2)\\n        check(img, cx, y, clamp01((t - 3.3 - i * 0.6) / 0.4), C_GRN, 4, 0.5)\\n        text(img, cx + 40, y, s, \\"sans\\", 34, C_MUT, al, anchor=\\"lm\\")\\n\\n\\nSCENES = [\\n    (\\"s01\\", \\"夜 · 提交之前\\", s01),\\n    (\\"s02\\", \\"提示 · 账号已停用\\", s02),\\n    (\\"s03\\", \\"误区 · 三个错误动作\\", s03),\\n    (\\"s04\\", \\"冷静 · 先分清类型\\", s04),\\n    (\\"s05\\", \\"自查 · 你是哪一种\\", s05),\\n    (\\"s06\\", \\"入口 · 正确的位置\\", s06),\\n    (\\"s07\\", \\"话术 · 只讲事实\\", s07),\\n    (\\"s08\\", \\"等待 · 别重复开单\\", s08),\\n    (\\"s09\\", \\"结果 · 误判被纠正\\", s09),\\n    (\\"s10\\", \\"结论 · 申诉的本质\\", s10),\\n]\\n\\n\\ndef load_timeline():\\n    with open(os.path.join(BASE, \\"timing.json\\"), encoding=\\"utf-8\\") as f:\\n        tm = json.load(f)\\n    d = {x[\\"id\\"]: x for x in tm}\\n    tl = []\\n    cursor = LEAD_IN\\n    for i, (sid, label, fn) in enumerate(SCENES):\\n        dur = d[sid][\\"dur\\"] + SCENE_GAP\\n        tl.append(dict(id=sid, idx=i + 1, label=label, fn=fn,\\n                       start=cursor, dur=dur, narr=d[sid][\\"dur\\"],\\n                       voice=d[sid][\\"voice\\"], text=d[sid][\\"text\\"]))\\n        cursor += dur\\n    total = cursor + TAIL\\n    return tl, total\\n\\n\\ndef render_frame(t, tl):\\n    img = make_base().copy()\\n    draw_bg(img, t, C_BLUE if t < tl[6][\\"start\\"] else (110, 150, 210),\\n            glowp=1.0 if t < tl[8][\\"start\\"] else 0.7)\\n    for sc in tl:\\n        if sc[\\"start\\"] <= t < sc[\\"start\\"] + sc[\\"dur\\"]:\\n            lt = t - sc[\\"start\\"]\\n            header(img, sc[\\"idx\\"], len(tl), sc[\\"label\\"], lt)\\n            sc[\\"fn\\"](img, lt, sc[\\"dur\\"])\\n            footer(img, t, tl[-1][\\"start\\"] + tl[-1][\\"dur\\"])\\n            # 场景边界压暗\\n            f = 1.0\\n            if lt < FADE:\\n                f = 0.55 + 0.45 * (lt / FADE)\\n            elif lt > sc[\\"dur\\"] - FADE:\\n                f = 0.55 + 0.45 * ((sc[\\"dur\\"] - lt) / FADE)\\n            if f < 0.999:\\n                arr = np.asarray(img, dtype=np.float32) * f\\n                img = Image.fromarray(arr.astype(np.uint8), \\"RGB\\")\\n            return img\\n    # 尾部\\n    last = tl[-1]\\n    if t >= last[\\"start\\"] + last[\\"dur\\"]:\\n        lt = t - last[\\"start\\"]\\n        header(img, last[\\"idx\\"], len(tl), last[\\"label\\"], lt)\\n        last[\\"fn\\"](img, lt, last[\\"dur\\"])\\n        footer(img, t, last[\\"start\\"] + last[\\"dur\\"])\\n        k = clamp01((t - (last[\\"start\\"] + last[\\"dur\\"])) / max(0.1, TAIL))\\n        arr = np.asarray(img, dtype=np.float32) * (1 - k)\\n        img = Image.fromarray(arr.astype(np.uint8), \\"RGB\\")\\n    return img\\n\\n\\ndef main():\\n    tl, total = load_timeline()\\n    nf = int(total * FPS)\\n    print(\\"TOTAL %.3fs  FRAMES %d\\" % (total, nf), flush=True)\\n    with open(os.path.join(BASE, \\"plan.json\\"), \\"w\\", encoding=\\"utf-8\\") as f:\\n        json.dump({\\"total\\": total, \\"frames\\": nf,\\n                   \\"scenes\\": [{k: v for k, v in s.items() if k != \\"fn\\"} for s in tl]},\\n                  f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=1)\\n\\n    if len(sys.argv) > 2 and sys.argv[1] == \\"--test\\":\\n        outd = os.path.join(BASE, \\"test\\")\\n        os.makedirs(outd, exist_ok=True)\\n        for spec in sys.argv[2].split(\\",\\"):\\n            tt = float(spec)\\n            render_frame(tt, tl).save(os.path.join(outd, \\"f_%05.1f.png\\" % tt))\\n            print(\\"saved\\", tt, flush=True)\\n        return\\n\\n    out = os.path.join(BASE, \\"video.mp4\\")\\n    cmd = [\\"ffmpeg\\", \\"-y\\", \\"-f\\", \\"rawvideo\\", \\"-pix_fmt\\", \\"rgb24\\",\\n           \\"-s\\", \\"%dx%d\\" % (W, H), \\"-r\\", str(FPS), \\"-i\\", \\"-\\",\\n           \\"-an\\", \\"-c:v\\", \\"libx264\\", \\"-preset\\", \\"veryfast\\", \\"-crf\\", \\"19\\",\\n           \\"-pix_fmt\\", \\"yuv420p\\", \\"-g\\", \\"120\\", \\"-movflags\\", \\"+faststart\\", out]\\n    proc = subprocess.Popen(cmd, stdin=subprocess.PIPE,\\n                            stdout=subprocess.DEVNULL, stderr=subprocess.PIPE)\\n    step = max(1, nf // 40)\\n    for i in range(nf):\\n        img = render_frame(i / FPS, tl)\\n        proc.stdin.write(img.tobytes())\\n        if i % step == 0:\\n            print(\\"FRAME %d/%d  %.1f%%\\" % (i, nf, 100.0 * i / nf), flush=True)\\n    proc.stdin.close()\\n    err = proc.stderr.read().decode(\\"utf-8\\", \\"ignore\\")\\n    rc = proc.wait()\\n    print(\\"FFMPEG_RC\\", rc, flush=True)\\n    if rc != 0:\\n        print(err[-2500:], flush=True)\\n\\n\\nif __name__ == \\"__main__\\":\\n    main()\\n", "path": "/data/data/com.termux/files/home/vt/render.py"}\n结果: ✅ 创建 /data/data/com.termux/files/home/vt/render.py (33849 字节)\n\nNow test render a few frames and verify with OCR + pixel stats.\n\nLet me render test frames at scene middles: 4, 12, 22, 32, 42, 52, 62, 72, 82, 92, 100.\n\nFirst get timeline. Let me run --test.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "cd ~/vt && python3 render.py --test 4,12,22,32,42,52,62,72,82,92,100 2>&1 \p tail -18", "timeout": 300}\n结果:     ~~~~^^\n  File "/data/data/com.termux/files/home/vt/render.py", line 858, in main\n    render_frame(tt, tl).save(os.path.join(outd, "f_%05.1f.png" % tt))\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^\n  File "/data/data/com.termux/files/home/vt/render.py", line 819, in render_frame\n    sc["fn"](img, lt, sc["dur"])\n    ~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File "/data/data/com.termux/files/home/vt/render.py", line 478, in s03\n    panel(img, (x0, y0 + dy, x0 + 460, y0 + 330 + dy),