UI design — cards are (17,25,41), which is also dark.\n\nHmm, the user complained before "画面93%~95%的像素是接近纯黑，全黑底+小字，毫无视觉层次". Now we have more elements but still overall very dark. Risk of the same complaint.\n\nI should brighten the overall palette to make it look more premium and less "black screen": \n- Raise background gradient: from (12,16,28) to (28,38,58) → more visible depth\n- Cards: (26,36,56) with borders (70,90,124)\n- Increase glow strength\n\nAlso text is white already.\n\nLet me improve: increase base gradient, increase blob strength, add a subtle top-to-bottom light, and increase panel fill.\n\nAlso I notice from OCR: "04 /w0" suggests header number overlapping? Probably OCR error. "10 /2" also OCR error. Fine.\n\nAnother issue: f_042 (scene 4) shows "冷静 e TERA A - 自动风控误判" — the node circle text "封禁" wasn't read; maybe because at t=42 the node alpha is fine. OCR misread. Theme: at 42s, scene 4 has been running... let me check: scene4 start = 1.6 + (9.264+0.7)+(10.68+0.7)+(8.856+0.7) = 1.6+9.964+11.38+9.556 = 32.5. So at 42, lt=9.5, dur=9.964. So near end. Fine.\n\nWait, scene 4 dur = 9.264+0.7 = 9.964, and at lt=9.5 we're in the fade-out zone (last 0.4s), so screen dark. That explains OCR garbling.\n\nAlso I should double check the layout for overlaps. One concern: header text at y=74 and "GITHUB 账号解封 · 实操指南" at right y=92 — fine.\n\nScene 1: clock at (1760,240) anchor rt, and text "AM · 截止前 6 小时" at y=336. The header right text is at y=92. No overlap.\n\nLet me improve brightness/contrast to avoid "太黑" complaint:\n- C_BG1 = (12,17,30), C_BG2 = (26,36,56)\n- grid alpha up to 14\n- vignette 0.32\n- blob strength 60\n- C_CARD = (24,34,54), C_CARD2=(30,42,64), C_BORD=(64,84,118)\n\nAlso add a subtle accent light streak at top.\n\nLet me also verify text is not clipped at edges: check border bands.\n\nAdditionally, check that content doesn't overlap the footer bar (y=1026) — scene 1 subtitle at 950-1012 ok; scene 3 caption at 990 centered with size 40 → height ~ 60, spans 990..1050 → overlaps footer! text anchor ct at y=990 means top at 990, bottom ~1050 → collides with footer line at 1026. Need to move up: y=975 with anchor ct still bottom 1035. Hmm anchor="ct" → y is top. Let me change those to anchor="cm" at y=985, so spans ~955-1015. Fine.\n\nScene 5: verdict stamp at 770 — inside panel (240..880). ok.\nScene 7: bottom text at 990 anchor ct → same overlap issue. Change to cm at 975.\nScene 3: caption at 990 ct → change to cm at 980.\nScene 2: translation at 950 ct → bottom ~1010, ok but close. Change to cm at 960.\n\nAlso scene 1 subtitle panel 950-1012 fine.\n\nLet me also check scene 6: fields at y = 690 + i*74 → 690, 764, 838; panel y-12..y+44 → last 826..882, inside browser (200..920). ok.\n\nScene 8: warning panel 640-730 inside main panel (300..780). ok.\n\nScene 9: status chip 240-320 and email card starts 350. ok.\n\nScene 7: notes at x 1450..1830, panel main ends 1400. ok. Note 4 at y=380+3*110=710..794. ok.\n\nScene 4: cards 880..1620 and 250..470 / 540..760. Title header at y 74-180. Card top 250 fine.\n\nScene 5: panel 250..1670 x, 240..880 y. Title at 276. rows 400..400+3*104+82 = 794. stamp at 726..818 — overlaps row 4 (y=712..794)! Row4: y = 400+3*104 = 712, to 794. Stamp at (1140..1560, 726..818) overlaps row 4 x 300..1620. Yes overlap. Move stamp lower or make rows shorter. Let me move stamp to y 830-900 outside panel? Panel ends 880. Better: reduce stamp position to (1120..1560, 700..790) still overlaps. \n\nAlternative: shift rows up and shrink: rows start 380, spacing 96, height 74 → last row 380+3*96=668..742. Then stamp at 770..860 inside panel. Good. Let me adjust: y = 380 + i*96, height 74, circle at y+37.\n\nStamp box 790..870, text at cm y=830. Panel ends 880. ok.\n\nLet me also reconsider: scene 5 title at 276, rows start 380 fine.\n\nNow let me apply all fixes: brightness palette, footer overlap, scene5 layout.\n\nAlso add: top light streak for depth.\n\nLet me patch the file.\n\nAdditionally, to make it feel more "1080p premium", maybe add subtle film grain? Not necessary.\n\nLet me apply patches via python replacements.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "cd ~/vt && python3 - <<'PYEOF'\\np='render.py'\\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\\n\\n# 1) 提亮整体色板\\ns=s.replace('C_BG1 = (7, 10, 18)','C_BG1 = (13, 19, 33)')\\ns=s.replace('C_BG2 = (17, 25, 41)','C_BG2 = (30, 42, 66)')\\ns=s.replace('C_CARD = (17, 25, 41)','C_CARD = (24, 34, 55)')\\ns=s.replace('C_CARD2 = (23, 33, 52)','C_CARD2 = (30, 43, 68)')\\ns=s.replace('C_BORD = (48, 64, 92)','C_BORD = (66, 88, 124)')\\ns=s.replace('C_MUT = (139, 157, 185)','C_MUT = (152, 172, 202)')\\ns=s.replace('C_DIM = (92, 108, 133)','C_DIM = (108, 126, 156)')\\n\\n# 2) 网格更可见 + 顶部光带 + 暗角减轻\\ns=s.replace(\\"fill=(120, 165, 235, 9), width=1)\\",\\"fill=(130, 175, 245, 16), width=1)\\")\\ns=s.replace(\\"d.line([(0, gy), (W, gy)], fill=(120, 165, 235, 9), width=1)\\",\\n            \\"d.line([(0, gy), (W, gy)], fill=(130, 175, 245, 16), width=1)\\")\\ns=s.replace(\\"vig = np.clip(1.0 - 0.42 * np.clip((r - 0.45) / 0.9, 0, 1) ** 1.4, 0, 1)\\",\\n            \\"vig = np.clip(1.0 - 0.34 * np.clip((r - 0.48) / 0.95, 0, 1) ** 1.4, 0, 1)\\")\\n\\n# 3) 光斑加强\\ns=s.replace(\\"b = blob(accent, 860, int(50 * glowp))\\",\\"b = blob(accent, 900, int(72 * glowp))\\")\\ns=s.replace(\\"b2 = blob((34, 84, 130), 980, 44)\\",\\"b2 = blob((46, 104, 158), 1020, 62)\\")\\n\\n# 4) 底部字幕避开进度条（ct -> cm，且上移）\\ns=s.replace('text(img, 960, 950, \\"三年积累，一瞬间全部变灰\\", \\"serif\\", 44, (240, 200, 196),\\\\n             al, anchor=\\"ct\\", bold=True)',\\n            'text(img, 960, 962, \\"三年积累，一瞬间全部变灰\\", \\"serif\\", 44, (240, 200, 196),\\\\n             al, anchor=\\"cm\\", bold=True)')\\ns=s.replace('''        text(img, W // 2, 990, \\"这三个动作，会让风控评分更高\\", \\"serif\\", 40,\\n             (232, 150, 146), al, anchor=\\"ct\\", bold=True)''',\\n            '''        text(img, W // 2, 972, \\"这三个动作，会让风控评分更高\\", \\"serif\\", 40,\\n             (238, 156, 152), al, anchor=\\"cm\\", bold=True)''')\\ns=s.replace('''        text(img, 960, 990, \\"只讲事实：你是谁 · 你没违规 · 请人工复核\\", \\"serif\\", 38,\\n             C_AMB, al, anchor=\\"ct\\", bold=True)''',\\n            '''        text(img, 960, 968, \\"只讲事实：你是谁 · 你没违规 · 请人工复核\\", \\"serif\\", 38,\\n             C_AMB, al, anchor=\\"cm\\", bold=True)''')\\n\\n# 5) 场景5 行距压缩，避免与判定印章重叠\\ns=s.replace(\\"        y = 400 + i * 104\\",\\"        y = 380 + i * 96\\")\\ns=s.replace(\\"        d.rounded_rectangle([300, y, 1620, y + 82], radius=10,\\",\\n            \\"        d.rounded_rectangle([300, y, 1620, y + 74], radius=10,\\")\\ns=s.replace(\\"        circle(img, 356, y + 41, 24, None, (60, 78, 106), 3)\\",\\n            \\"        circle(img, 356, y + 37, 23, None, (74, 96, 130), 3)\\")\\ns=s.replace(\\"        check(img, 356, y + 41, clamp01((t - st - 0.25) / 0.45), C_GRN)\\",\\n            \\"        check(img, 356, y + 37, clamp01((t - st - 0.25) / 0.45), C_GRN)\\")\\ns=s.replace('        text(img, 404, y + 41, r, \\"sans\\", 32, C_TXT, al, anchor=\\"lm\\")',\\n            '        text(img, 404, y + 37, r, \\"sans\\", 32, C_TXT, al, anchor=\\"lm\\")')\\ns=s.replace('        blit(img, 1180, 770, s, sp, anchor=\\"cm\\", rot=4)\\\\n        d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\\\n        d.rounded_rectangle([1140, 726, 1560, 818], radius=10,\\\\n                            outline=(70, 150, 95), width=3)',\\n            '        blit(img, 1170, 806, s, sp, anchor=\\"cm\\", rot=4)\\\\n        d = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\\\\n        d.rounded_rectangle([1120, 762, 1580, 852], radius=10,\\\\n                            outline=(80, 168, 106), width=3)')\\n\\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\\nprint(\\"patched ok\\")\\nPYEOF\\npython3 render.py --test 4,14,22,34,44,54,64,74,84,94,102 2>&1 \p tail -14", "timeout": 300}\n结果: patched ok\nTOTAL 109.520s  FRAMES 6571\nsaved 4.0\nsaved 14.0\nsaved 22.0\nsaved 34.0\nsaved 44.0\nsaved 54.0\nsaved 64.0\nsaved 74.0\nsaved 84.0\nsaved 94.0\nsaved 102.0\n\n\nNow verify brightness + check no overlap issues + no clipping. Also crop check footer region for scene3 caption.\n\nLet me check stats.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "cd ~/vt && python3 - <<'EOF'\\nfrom PIL import Image\\nimport numpy as np, glob\\nfor f in sorted(glob.glob('test/*.png')):\\n    a=np.asarray(Image.open(f).convert('RGB')); g=a.mean(axis=2)\\n    near_black=(g<18).mean()*100\\n    print(\\"%-14s mean=%5.1f p50=%5.1f p99=%5.1f 近黑=%.1f%% 亮=%.2f%%\\"\\n          %(f.split('/')[-1],g.mean(),np.percentile(g,50),np.percentile(g,99),near_black,(g>120).mean()*100))\\nEOF", "timeout": 120}\n结果: f_004.0.png    mean= 33.0 p50= 29.3 p99=144.7 近黑=2.0% 亮=1.44%\nf_012.0.png    mean= 23.3 p50= 20.0 p99=103.3 近黑=24.3% 亮=0.67%\nf_014.0.png    mean= 31.8 p50= 26.0 p99=151.7 近黑=0.5% 亮=1.36%\nf_022.0.png    mean= 32.0 p50= 25.3 p99=169.7 近黑=0.4% 亮=1.33%\nf_032.0.png    mean= 24.1 p50= 22.3 p99=176.0 近黑=34.1% 亮=1.77%\nf_034.0.png    mean= 35.8 p50= 36.7 p99= 62.3 近黑=0.5% 亮=0.50%\nf_042.0.png    mean= 23.5 p50= 22.0 p99=134.0 近黑=27.3% 亮=1.22%\nf_044.0.png    mean= 32.2 p50= 26.3 p99=130.0 近黑=0.5% 亮=1.05%\nf_052.0.png    mean= 25.7 p50= 24.0 p99=232.0 近黑=26.9% 亮=1.50%\nf_054.0.png    mean= 25.8 p50= 19.7 p99= 46.3 近黑=3.3% 亮=0.36%\nf_062.0.png    mean= 23.8 p50= 19.0 p99=123.3 近黑=27.6% 亮=1.18%\nf_064.0.png    mean= 29.1 p50= 26.7 p99=123.7 近黑=27.4% 亮=1.06%\nf_072.0.png    mean= 24.8 p50= 22.3 p99=165.7 近黑=24.0% 亮=2.24%\nf_074.0.png    mean= 33.2 p50= 25.7 p99=169.7 近黑=0.3% 亮=2.36%\nf_082.0.png    mean= 23.2 p50= 22.3 p99=169.7 近黑=29.4% 亮=1.47%\nf_084.0.png    mean= 32.8 p50= 26.7 p99=169.7 近黑=0.5% 亮=1.64%\nf_092.0.png    mean= 23.3 p50= 23.0 p99=146.3 近黑=31.8% 亮=1.35%\nf_094.0.png    mean= 32.6 p50= 25.7 p99=159.0 近黑=0.5% 亮=1.52%\nf_100.0.png    mean= 24.8 p50= 20.3 p99=194.7 近黑=31.0% 亮=2.97%\nf_102.0.png    mean= 39.7 p50= 36.0 p99=197.3 近黑=0.3% 亮=3.21%\n\n\n🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "cd ~/vt && python3 - <<'EOF'\\n# 检测内容是否越出安全区（上下留白带、左右留白带是否被内容压到）\\nfrom PIL import Image\\nimport numpy as np, glob\\nfor f in sorted(glob.glob('test/*.png')):\\n    a=np.asarray(Image.open(f).convert('RGB')); g=a.mean(axis=2)\\n    edges={'left':g[:,0:26],'right':g[:,-26:],'top':g[0:26,:],'bot':g[-26:,:]}\\n    bad={k:round(float(v.max()),1) for k,v in edges.items()}\\n    print(f.split('/')[-1], \\"边缘最大亮度\\", bad)\\nEOF", "timeout": 120}\n结果: f_004.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 44.0, 'right': 73.3, 'top': 29.7, 'bot': 58.3}\nf_012.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 24.3, 'right': 24.3, 'top': 27.3, 'bot': 49.7}\nf_014.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 44.0, 'right': 44.0, 'top': 41.0, 'bot': 107.0}\nf_022.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 44.0, 'right': 44.0, 'top': 75.3, 'bot': 82.3}\nf_032.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 34.3, 'right': 54.3, 'top': 81.3, 'bot': 103.7}\nf_034.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 48.3, 'right': 50.7, 'top': 101.7, 'bot': 60.7}\nf_042.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 24.3, 'right': 28.0, 'top': 61.7, 'bot': 86.0}\nf_044.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 44.0, 'right': 48.3, 'top': 43.3, 'bot': 52.3}\nf_052.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 24.3, 'right': 24.3, 'top': 83.3, 'bot': 95.0}\nf_054.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 44.0, 'right': 52.3, 'top': 44.3, 'bot': 50.0}\nf_062.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 25.0, 'right': 24.3, 'top': 68.0, 'bot': 28.7}\nf_064.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 45.0, 'right': 41.7, 'top': 53.0, 'bot': 63.3}\nf_072.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 28.0, 'right': 24.3, 'top': 60.3, 'bot': 42.7}\nf_074.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 44.0, 'right': 44.7, 'top': 38.7, 'bot': 89.3}\nf_082.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 24.3, 'right': 29.3, 'top': 17.7, 'bot': 33.7}\nf_084.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 44.0, 'right': 51.3, 'top': 37.0, 'bot': 108.3}\nf_092.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 24.3, 'right': 26.3, 'top': 40.0, 'bot': 35.7}\nf_094.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 44.0, 'right': 47.0, 'top': 29.3, 'bot': 50.0}\nf_100.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 24.3, 'right': 24.3, 'top': 38.7, 'bot': 65.7}\nf_102.0.png 边缘最大亮度 {'left': 44.0, 'right': 44.0, 'top': 34.3, 'bot': 50.0}\n\n\nInteresting: frames at scene boundaries (12.0, 32.0, 42.0, 52.0, 62.0, 72.0, 82.0, 92.0, 100.0) show 近黑 24-34% and lower mean — these are the boundary dip frames (fade to 0.55). Actually near_black 24-34% is the fade. Hmm but that's during fade only. But e.g. f_012 — scene 2 starts at 1.6+9.264+0.7=11.564, so 12.0 is lt=0.436 → not in fade (FADE=0.4, lt<0.4 fade). At lt=0.436 fade done, f=1.0. So why near_black 24%?\n\nWait — 12.0: scene2 lt=0.436. Hmm at that time the browser panel hasn't appeared much... Actually near_black 24.3% means 24% of pixels < 18 brightness. Base gradient starts at (13,19,33) → mean 21.7 which is > 18. Hmm, mean of (13,19,33)=21.7. So pixels near top should be ~21.7. But with vignette multiply it can drop.\n\nHmm, f_012 近黑=24.3% and mean 23.3. But f_014 (also scene 2, lt=2.4) mean=31.8, 近黑=0.5%. So at 12.0 something is dark — the panel/browser is drawn with fill (12,17,28) covering a large area! Yes, the browser panel covers 250..1670 x 210..890 = ~ 1.42M px of 2.07M = 68%... no, 1420*680 = 966k px = 46% of frame. Its fill (12,17,28) mean=19 → below 18? mean 19 > 18. Hmm, borderline. Plus inner areas.\n\nOK so panels being dark is intentional but they're too dark relative to the new bg. Let me lighten panel fills: (12,17,28) → (20,29,46), inner screen (13,18,30) → (18,25,40), etc.\n\nActually many hardcoded dark fills throughout scenes. Let me bump them globally:\n- (12, 17, 28) → (21, 30, 47)\n- (15, 22, 36) → (24, 34, 52)\n- (14, 20, 33) → (23, 33, 51)\n- (11, 17, 29) → (20, 29, 46)\n- (10, 14, 24) → (19, 28, 44)\n- (13, 18, 30) → (20, 28, 44)\n- (17, 23, 36) → (26, 36, 54)\n- (18, 26, 41) → (27, 38, 57)\n- (19, 27, 43) → (28, 39, 58)\n- (20, 28, 44) → (29, 40, 59)\n- (10, 15, 26) → (19, 27, 43)\n- (16, 24, 40) → (25, 35, 53)\n- (14, 20, 34) → (23, 33, 51)\n- (16, 32, 26) → keep (green tint) maybe (22, 44, 34)\n- (32, 20, 22) → (46, 28, 30)\n- (26, 20, 30) → (40, 30, 42)\n- (34, 26, 20) → (48, 38, 30)\n\nAlso 近黑 threshold: with the bg lightened, near-black shouldn't be dominant.\n\nLet me do a global brightness lift at the end instead: it's simpler and guarantees no near-black dominance. But that would wash out the dark aesthetic slightly. A modest gamma/brightness lift applied at frame output: img = arr*1.0 + 10? That lifts blacks to 10 → mean +10. Combined with panel lightening.\n\nI'll do both: lighten panel fills + apply a gentle "lift" (add 8 to all channels, then multiply 1.03). Actually simpler: lighten the palette properly. Let me do the replacements and also a mild final lift of +6 for the deepest tones.\n\nLet me implement a final tone curve in render_frame: after drawing, apply lift:\narr = arr * 1.04 + 7 — cheap numpy op, 6.2M ops ~ 10ms per frame → adds 65s. Acceptable but let's avoid extra cost: apply lift only via precomputed LUT? np.take with 256 LUT on uint8 is fast-ish but still per-pixel.\n\nBetter: bake lift into base gradient (already done via palette) and lighten panel fills. Skip per-frame lut.\n\nLet me just do the color replacements and check.\n\nAlso: near-black at scene 12.0 might be due to the panel. Let me verify after fix.\n\nAnother consideration: the user's complaint historically was "黑底小字". Now we have panels, cards, colors. Lightening fills will help.\n\nLet me apply.\n\nAlso add a gradient sheen inside large panels? Skip.\n\nLet me patch.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "cd ~/vt && python3 - <<'PYEOF'\\np='render.py'\\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\\n# 统一提亮所有面板/底色\\nrepl = {\\n \\"(12, 17, 28)\\":\\"(23, 33, 51)\\", \\"(15, 22, 36)\\":\\"(26, 37, 56)\\", \\"(14, 20, 33)\\":\\"(25, 36, 55)\\",\\n \\"(11, 17, 29)\\":\\"(22, 32, 50)\\", \\"(10, 14, 24)\\":\\"(21, 30, 47)\\", \\"(13, 18, 30)\\":\\"(22, 31, 48)\\",\\n \\"(17, 23, 36)\\":\\"(28, 39, 58)\\", \\"(18, 26, 41)\\":\\"(29, 41, 61)\\", \\"(19, 27, 43)\\":\\"(30, 42, 62)\\",\\n \\"(20, 28, 44)\\":\\"(31, 43, 63)\\", \\"(10, 15, 26)\\":\\"(21, 30, 47)\\", \\"(16, 24, 40)\\":\\"(27, 38, 57)\\",\\n \\"(14, 18, 30)\\":\\"(23, 32, 49)\\", \\"(16, 22, 34)\\":\\"(26, 36, 55)\\",\\n \\"(18, 32, 26)\\":\\"(26, 50, 38)\\", \\"(32, 20, 22)\\":\\"(52, 31, 33)\\", \\"(26, 20, 30)\\":\\"(44, 32, 45)\\",\\n \\"(34, 26, 20)\\":\\"(54, 42, 32)\\", \\"(20, 27, 42)\\":\\"(31, 42, 62)\\", \\"(20, 26, 40)\\":\\"(31, 41, 61)\\",\\n \\"(16, 24, 38)\\":\\"(27, 38, 57)\\", \\"(12, 18, 30)\\":\\"(23, 32, 49)\\", \\"(12, 20, 32)\\":\\"(23, 34, 52)\\",\\n \\"(30, 40, 58)\\":\\"(42, 55, 78)\\",\\n}\\nfor k,v in repl.items():\\n    s=s.replace(k,v)\\n# 输出端做一次轻微提亮，保证深层色调不发死\\ns=s.replace('''def render_frame(t, tl):\\n    img = make_base().copy()''','''LIFT = 9\\n_lut = np.arange(256, dtype=np.int16)\\n_lut = np.clip(_lut + LIFT, 0, 255).astype(np.uint8)\\n\\n\\ndef render_frame(t, tl):\\n    img = make_base().copy()''')\\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\\nprint(\\"ok\\")\\nPYEOF\\npython3 render.py --test 6,14,26,36,46,56,66,76,86,96,104 2>&1 \p tail -13", "timeout": 300}\n结果: ok\nTOTAL 109.520s  FRAMES 6571\nsaved 6.0\nsaved 14.0\nsaved 26.0\nsaved 36.0\nsaved 46.0\nsaved 56.0\nsaved 66.0\nsaved 76.0\nsaved 86.0\nsaved 96.0\nsaved 104.0\n\n\n🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "cd ~/vt && rm -f test/f_004.0.png test/f_012.0.png test/f_022.0.png test/f_032.0.png test/f_034.0.png test/f_042.0.png test/f_044.0.png test/f_052.0.png test/f_054.0.png test/f_062.0.png test/f_064.0.png test/f_072.0.png test/f_074.0.png test/f_082.0.png test/f_084.0.png test/f_092.0.png test/f_094.0.png test/f_100.0.png test/f_102.0.png test/f_014.0.png && python3 - <<'EOF'\\nfrom PIL import Image\\nimport numpy as np, glob\\nfor f in sorted(glob.glob('test/*.png')):\\n    a=np.asarray(Image.open(f).convert('RGB')); g=a.mean(axis=2)\\n    print(\\"%-14s mean=%5.1f 近黑=%.1f%% 亮=%.2f%%\\"%(f.split('/')[-1],g.mean(),(g<18).mean()*100,(g>120).mean()*100))\\nEOF", "timeout": 120}\n结果: f_006.0.png    mean= 38.2 近黑=0.5% 亮=2.28%\nf_026.0.png    mean= 37.6 近黑=0.4% 亮=1.32%\nf_036.0.png    mean= 36.9 近黑=0.4% 亮=1.27%\nf_046.0.png    mean= 40.1 近黑=0.5% 亮=1.55%\nf_056.0.png    mean= 35.6 近黑=0.5% 亮=0.93%\nf_066.0.png    mean= 36.1 近黑=0.3% 亮=0.78%\nf_076.0.png    mean= 38.9 近黑=0.3% 亮=2.40%\nf_086.0.png    mean= 37.9 近黑=0.5% 亮=1.66%\nf_096.0.png    mean= 24.5 近黑=22.7% 亮=0.77%\nf_104.0.png    mean= 39.6 近黑=0.3% 亮=3.22%\n\n\nNow mean ~36-40, near-black <1%. Good. f_096 has 22.7% near-black — that's the fade boundary at scene 9 end (scene9 ends at?). Let me check: scenes start; scene 9 start = ? Total 109.52. Let's compute: durations: s01 9.964, s02 11.38, s03 9.556, s04 9.964, s05 10.708, s06 11.188, s07 12.868, s08 10.036, s09 8.836, s10 10.42.\nCumulative from 1.6: \ns01: 1.6 → 11.564\ns02: 11.564 → 22.944\ns03: 22.944 → 32.5\ns04: 32.5 → 42.464\ns05: 42.464 → 53.172\ns06: 53.172 → 64.36\ns07: 64.36 → 77.228\ns08: 77.228 → 87.264\ns09: 87.264 → 96.1\ns10: 96.1 → 106.52\nthen TAIL 3 → 109.52\n\nSo 96.0 is right at scene 9's end fade (96.1-0.4=95.7 to 96.1 → fade down). Yes, 96.0 is in fade → near black 22.7% explained. Fine, intentional.\n\nNow let me do a visual sanity check on one frame: crop regions and OCR to confirm text present, and check specific layout — e.g., scene 5 stamp vs rows overlap.\n\nLet me OCR the new frames.\n\nAlso I want to double-check the scene 5 layout via OCR reading both rows and stamp text.\n\nThen start full render in background.\n\nLet me OCR all 11 frames.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "cd ~/vt && for f in test/*.png; do echo \\"== $(basename $f)\\"; tesseract \\"$f\\" - -l chi_sim+eng --psm 11 2>/dev/null \p tr -s '\\\\n ' ' ' \p head -c 620; echo; done", "timeout": 400}\n结果: == f_006.0.png\nGITHUB 账号解雪 实操指南 (1) WAL % - 提交之前 02:00 AM 。 截止前6小时 量 e nn e nm nn e 有 nm nn e e 有 量 e 有 量 e 有 有 量 e 有 nm nn e 有 登录 GitHub，准备提交毕业设计 \n== f_026.0.png\nGITHUB 账号解雪 03 /10 误区 三个错误动作 注册小号 切换网络 狂发邮件 换个身份继续 挂代理换IP 一小时十几封 违反一人一号 风控评分上升 被判骚扰冻结 X X X \n== f_036.0.png\nGITHUB 账号解雪 实操指南 04 /0 冷静 e iERA A - 自动风控误判 垃圾信息检测把你误标成 spam 账号 一可申诉，成功率 B (=) \\ B 类 .真实违规 人 盗版、攻击 具、刷量、; /I 接口 一申诉基本无效 \n== f_046.0.png\n05 /10 GITHUB 账号解封。 实操指南 自查 - 你是哪一种 自查清