0.708, ends 53.172. At t=50, lt=7.54 → stamp visible.\n\nLet me render 50 and 30 (scene3 caption), 20 (scene2 caption), 70 (scene7 notes).\n\nAlso check scene 9 status chip.\n\nRender additional test frames: 20, 30, 50, 70, 90.\n\nThen start full render.\n\nActually good enough — but let me verify the stamp and captions render. Quick test.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "cd ~/vt && python3 render.py --test 20,31,50,70,90 2>&1 \p tail -6 && for f in test/f_020.0.png test/f_031.0.png test/f_050.0.png test/f_070.0.png test/f_090.0.png; do echo \\"== $(basename $f)\\"; tesseract \\"$f\\" - -l chi_sim+eng --psm 11 2>/dev/null \p tr -s '\\\\n ' ' ' \p head -c 560; echo; done", "timeout": 400}\n结果: TOTAL 109.520s  FRAMES 6571\nsaved 20.0\nsaved 31.0\nsaved 50.0\nsaved 70.0\nsaved 90.0\n== f_020.0.png\n02 /10 GITHUB 账号解封 ”实操指南 提示 账号已停用 [ X X ] github.com/settings/profile . Your account has been suspended 您的账号已被停 违反《可接受 政策》 CaoXiangWang/dotfiles UNAVAILABLE CaoXiangWang/study-notes UNAVAILABLE CaoXiangWang/thesis-2026 UNAVAILABLE UNAVAILABLE CaoXiangWang/harness 三年积累，一瞬间全部变灰 \n== f_031.0.png\n03 /10 GITHUB 账号解封 ”实操指南 误区 - 三个错误动作 注册小号 切换网络 狂发邮件 换个身份继续 挂代理换IP 一小时十几封 违反一人一号 风控评分上升 被判骚扰冻结 X 这三个动作，会让风控评分更高 \n== f_050.0.png\nGITHUB 账号解封。 实操指南 05 /10 自查 - 你是哪一种 自查清单. 六项都干净才算误判 SA 没有刷星、刷关注、刷fork SA 没有上传盗版或玻解资源 SA 没有批量注册、批量操作 s SO 没有 VE 用API、疏取数据 Re \n== f_070.0.png\nGITHUB 账号解雪 实操指南 07 /0 话林:只讲事实 Re: Account Suspension Appeal To: support@github.com Hello GitHub Support team, 我是进 My account (CaoXiangWang) was suspended by your automated spam detection. ”我没有违规 I have reviewed my activity: no spam, M FERK no copyright violation, no automation. Could a human please review my account? M 不要指责 \n== f_090.0.png\n09 /10 GITHUB 账号解雪 实操指南 4k “azs - 误判被纠正 Suspended Oct 30 15:57 UTC GitHub Support support@github.com Hi CaoXiangWang, Sometimes our spam detecting systems highlight accounts that need to be manually reviewed. \n\n\nf_050 (scene 5, lt=7.54): stamp should be visible ("判定：SPAM