arted successfully\nList of devices attached\nemulator-5554	offline\n\n\n\nadb_up.sh permission denied when invoked via absolute path (need bash). And emulator-5554 offline.\n\nLet me run: bash adb_up.sh in ddsh dir.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "cd /data/data/com.termux/files/home/ddsh && bash adb_up.sh 2>&1 \p tail -6; echo \\"---\\"; adb devices 2>&1 \p tail -5", "timeout": 240}\n结果: ✅ 已连接 127.0.0.1:5555  (uid=2000(shell))\n---\nList of devices attached\n127.0.0.1:5555	device\nemulator-5554	device\n\n\n\nadb shell available on 127.0.0.1:5555. Now do screen off → on.\n\nCheck current wakefulness, then keyevent 26 (power), sleep 2, keyevent 26 again, then verify.\n\nNote: turning screen on may require unlocking (swipe). I'll add keyevent 82 (menu) or swipe to dismiss. Let me do: power off, sleep 2, power on, sleep 1, swipe up to unlock if needed.\n\nActually previously verified Awake → Asleep → Awake. Let me just do power toggle twice and verify dumpsys power \p grep mWakefulness.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "D=127.0.0.1:5555; adb -s $D shell 'dumpsys power \p grep -E \\"mWakefulness=\pDisplay Power\\"' 2>&1 \p head -3; echo \\"--- 息屏 ---\\"; adb -s $D shell input keyevent 26; sleep 2; adb -s $D shell 'dumpsys power \p grep mWakefulness=' 2>&1 \p head -2; echo \\"--- 亮屏 ---\\"; adb -s $D shell input keyevent 26; sleep 2; adb -s $D shell 'dumpsys power \p grep mWakefulness=' 2>&1 \p head -2", "timeout": 240}\n结果:   mWakefulness=Awake\nDisplay Power: com.android.server.power.PowerManagerService$1@f5a8760\n--- 息屏 ---\n  mWakefulness=Asleep\n--- 亮屏 ---\n  mWakefulness=Awake\n\n\nVerified: Awake → Asleep → Awake.\n\nAlso need to check auto-rotate is off (system rule: never enable auto-rotate; if detected enabled, must disable). Let me check accelerometer_rotation setting and turn it off if 1.\n\nAlso release wake lock.\n\nThen final report.\n\nLet me check rotation setting via adb.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "D=127.0.0.1:5555; R=$(adb