ght:100%;}\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    font-family:"Noto Sans JP",system-ui,-apple-system,"Hiragino Sans","Yu Gothic",sans-serif;\n    color:var(--text);\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(1100px 560px at 8% -12%, #1a2334 0%, transparent 62%),\n      radial-gradient(900px 520px at 108% 6%, #241c36 0%, transparent 58%),\n      var(--bg);\n    min-height:100dvh;\n    overflow-x:hidden;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n  }\n  /* ===== ヘッダー ===== */\n  .topbar{\n    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;\n    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\n    padding:14px 16px;\n    background:rgba(14,17,23,.72);\n    backdrop-filter:blur(14px) saturate(140%);\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px) saturate(140%);\n    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);\n  }\n  .icon-btn{\n    width:42px;height:42px;flex:0 0 auto;\n    display:grid;place-items:center;\n    border-radius:13px;border:1px solid var(--line);\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#1d2431,#161b24);\n    color:var(--text);cursor:pointer;\n    transition:transform .18s var(--ease), background .18s, border-color .18s;\n  }\n  .icon-btn:active{transform:scale(.92);background:#232c3c;}\n  .icon-btn svg{width:21px;height:21px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.9;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  .brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1.15;margin-left:2px;flex:1;min-width:0;}\n  .brand b{font-size:15.5px;letter-spacing:.02em;}\n  .brand span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;}\n  ...\n```\n\nContinue with drawers etc. This will be long but fine.\n\nLet me just write the whole thing carefully in the create_file call.\n\nI need to make sure the HTML is valid and complete. Let me draft the full content mentally and write.\n\nSections:\n1. style\n2. topbar\n3. backdrop\n4. left drawer (nav)\n5. right drawer (settings)\n6. main content: cabinet with 4 drawers + explanation cards\n7. script\n\nLet me write it out.\n\nF