(toast "已选择 设置"). Wait, the tap at 72,244 hit the hamburger, drawer opened, but then... the toast says "已选择 设置". Hmm, that might be from tapping at the same coordinate again? No, only one tap.\n\nActually wait — maybe the first tap opened the drawer, and the screenshot/dump happened 2 seconds later. But the toast "已选择 设置" suggests a nav item was clicked. Possibly the tap coordinates landed on the nav item because the drawer animated in and... no, a single tap can't do both.\n\nHmm, actually maybe the drawer was already open from a previous state? No.\n\nWait — maybe the tap at 72,244 opened the drawer (btnLeft), and then the drawer opened ON TOP, and the tap was registered... no.\n\nLet me reconsider: maybe the browser rendered the page zoomed, so 72,244 landed on something else. But "打开菜单" bounds are 30-114, 202-286, so 72,244 is center → it IS the hamburger.\n\nSo the drawer should be open. But then why "已选择 设置"? \n\nOH — I see. The drawer opened, and then... Actually maybe there's a possibility: the tap event fired on button, drawer opened, then `beep(520)`. Then the toast would be... no toast on open.\n\nHmm, "已选择 设置" means a nav item with text 设置 was clicked. \n\nUnless... the previous dump was stale and the click actually happened on the drawer that was already rendered visible? \n\nLet me just look at current screenshot to see the actual state. That's the reliable way.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "ADB=\\"adb -s 127.0.0.1:5555\\"; $ADB shell screencap -p /sdcard/v2.png; $ADB pull /sdcard/v2.png $HOME/v2.png >/dev/null 2>&1; cd $HOME && tesseract v2.png out2 -l chi_sim --psm 6 2>/dev/null; cat out2.txt \p head -30"}\n结果: 211810 国          一全四别1G94\nQ_ 加 抽居式界面 \p pr， 六 ) 各\n三 ”抽导式界面                这\n抽屠式界面\n木质收纳柜                           4层\n文件\nDOCUMENTS            人\n合同、保修卡、收据三件套，按年度用信封装\n好分隔存放。\n2026年度 ) { 需归还 )】 ( 原件\n工具                、\n本\n线缆\n”CABbLES\n和 QQ 三     伯\n\n\nThe drawer is NOT open in the screenshot — it's the main page. And the toast said "已选择 设置". \n\nSo what happened: the tap at 72,244 opened the drawer... no wait. If drawer was closed and I tapped hamburger, drawer opens. Then the dump happened 2s later. But the dump shows no 菜单/首页/抽屉一览 items — because nav items in the drawer... hmm, actually the dump did NOT show 首页/抽屉一览/统计/通知/设置 as text nodes. It showed "已选择 设置" (a toast).\n\nSo sequence: tap opened drawer → then something clicked 设置 → drawer closed.\n\nPossibly my tap at 72,244 registered TWICE (input tap sometimes double-fires?) No...\n\nActually! I bet the issue: the drawer opened with animation, and the nav items are at the top area. x=72 falls within the drawer width (78vw of 720 = 561... wait, but CSS px vs device px). Hmm.\n\nActually more likely: the tap happened, drawer opened. Then the *same* tap was interpreted... no.\n\nAlternative: There may have been a leftover click. Let me think about coordinates. If CSS px = device px here (browser at 100% zoom on 720px wide screen... device-width viewport means CSS width = 720/dpr. If dpr=2, CSS width=360px, so drawer width min(78vw, 305px) = min(280.8, 305) = 280.8 CSS px = 561 device px.\n\nNav items: padding 10px in drawer, each item ~60 CSS px tall. First item 首页 at y ≈ topbar 13+42+13 = 68 CSS px → wait topbar height = 13+42+13 = 68 CSS px = 136 device px. But "打开菜单" bounds in device px were 202-286, center 244. So device y 202 corresponds to CSS y 101. Hmm, that means topbar starts at ~101 CSS? That's because of browser UI (address bar) offset.\n\nAnyway — after drawer opens, nav item 设置 is 5th item, at roughly y = 101(top offset)+... \n\nIf tap at device (72,244) opens drawer, the drawer's panel-head 菜单 + close button occupies from top of panel (device y≈101) down. So device y=244 would be inside the drawer's nav list! Specifically panel-head is 16+~13+12 padding ≈ 45 CSS px, then nav-list starts. y=244 device = 122 CSS. panel starts at 101 CSS, head ends ~146 CSS. So y=122 is within the panel head — the 关闭 button is at right side.\n\nHmm but "已选择 设置" toast means a nav item was selected. \n\nOH WAIT. I understand now! The tap opened the drawer, and my `input tap` may have been delivered, drawer opened. THEN, the uiautomator dump ran... and during dump... no.\n\nActually maybe the simplest explanation: **two taps were delivered**. `adb shell input tap` is a single tap. Unless the browser had a pending touch.\n\nLet me stop guessing and just verify by taking a clean screenshot right after tapping the hamburger, with a fresh dump. Let me first reload the page to reset state, then tap and immediately dump.\n\nActually — the key realization: maybe the drawer DID open, nav 设置 got clicked by my tap because after opening, the drawer overlays position 72,244... no, the tap happens once.\n\nHmm, unless: `input tap` sends DOWN and UP. The click handler on btnLeft fires on UP, which opens the drawer synchronously. But the UP event... no, it's the same event.\n\nBut! Android `input tap` = down + up at same point. If the browser processes down/up, the button click fires once. Drawer opens with CSS transform transition (0.38s). No second click.\n\nUNLESS the browser fired both `click` on btnLeft AND then a click on the element now under that point... That doesn't happen in browsers.\n\nLet me just re-test cleanly. Reload page, then tap, then screenshot immediately.\n\nActually — maybe I should reconsider: perhaps the toast text "已选择 设置" came from an EARLIER interaction in a previous session (leftover page state)? No, page was freshly loaded.\n\nHmm, but actually! Maybe the browser restored the page from cache including JS state? No, toast would be gone.\n\nLet me look at whether 设置 nav item could be at device y=244 when drawer is open. The drawer panel starts at top:0 of the viewport. Viewport top = below browser UI ≈ device y 101*2? Let's figure the viewport: "打开菜单" node at device y 202-286. In CSS px with dpr=2, that's 101-143 CSS. Topbar padding-top 13, so viewport top ≈ 88 CSS px → device 176.\n\nDrawer panel: top:0 → device y=176. panel-head: padding 16px top → h3 at 176+32=208 device... panel-head height ≈ 16+13(line)+12 = 41 CSS = 82 device → ends at 258 device. So device y=244 is inside panel-head → that's the 关闭 (close) button area? Close button is at right (x large), so x=72 would be on the h3 菜单 text. Tapping there does nothing.\n\nSo tapping 72,244 again → nothing. Not 设置.\n\nSo how did 设置 get selected?! \n\nUnless... the FIRST tap at 72,244 wasn't on the hamburger at all but the page hadn't finished loading, and my earlier `input tap` opened drawer... \n\nI'm going in circles. Let me just do a clean controlled test.\n\nPlan:\n1. Force-stop browser / reload page via am start again\n2. Wait\n3. Screenshot to confirm closed state\n4. Tap hamburger center from fresh dump\n5. Immediately screenshot\n\nLet me do that.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "ADB=\\"adb -s 127.0.0.1:5555\\"; $ADB shell am start -a android.intent.action.VIEW -d \\"http://127.0.0.1:8791/drawer_ui.html?r=1\\" -p com.heytap.browser >/dev/null 2>&1; sleep 6; $ADB shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/u3.xml >/dev/null 2>&1; $ADB pull /sdcard/u3.xml $HOME/u3.xml >/dev/null 2>&1; cd $HOME && python3 -c \\"\\nimport re\\ns=open('u3.xml',encoding='utf-8').read()\\nfor m in re.finditer(r'text=\\\\\\"(打开菜单)\\\\\\"[^>]*bounds=\\\\\\"\\\\[(\\\\d+),(\\\\d+)\\\\]\\\\[(\\\\d+),(\\\\d+)\\\\]\\\\\\"',s):\\n    print(m.group(1), m.group(2),m.group(3),m.group(4),m.group(5))\\nprint('has 首页:', '首页' in s)\\n\\""}\n结果: 打开菜单 30 202 114 288\nhas 首页: False\n\n\n🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "ADB=\\"adb -s 127.0.0.1:5555\\"; $ADB shell input tap 72 245; sleep 1; $ADB shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/u4.xml >/dev/null 2>&1; $ADB pull /sdcard/u4.xml $HOME/u4.xml >/dev/null 2>&1; cd $HOME && grep -o 'text=\\"[^\\"]\\\\+\\"' u4.xml \p head -40"}\n结果: text="抽屉式界面 ｜ Drawer UI"\ntext="打开菜单"\ntext="抽屉式界面"\ntext="DRAWER DEMO"\ntext="打开设置"\ntext="菜单"\ntext="关闭"\ntext="&#127968;"\ntext="首页"\ntext="Home"\ntext="&#128450;️"\ntext="抽屉一览"\ntext="Drawers"\ntext="&#128202;"\ntext="统计"\ntext="Analytics"\ntext="&#128276;"\ntext="通知"\ntext="Notifications"\ntext="⚙️"\ntext="设置"\ntext="Settings"\ntext="抽屉式界面"\ntext="左侧菜单和右侧设置是侧边抽屉，下方木箱是真正的「抽屉」。按下把手就会向前拉出，露出里面的东西。"\ntext="木质收纳柜"\ntext="4 层"\ntext="文件 DOCUMENTS"\ntext="合同、保修卡、收据三件套，按年度用信封装好分隔存放。"\ntext="2026 年度"\ntext="需归还"\ntext="原件"\ntext="工具 TOOLS"\ntext="• "\ntext="螺丝刀（十字・一字 各 3 种规格）"\ntext="• "\ntext="卷尺 5m、内六角扳手套装"\ntext="• "\ntext="扎带、双面胶、美纹纸胶带"\ntext="线缆 CABLES"\ntext="Type-C、Lightning、HDMI、LAN 分别装入小袋并捆扎整齐。"\n\n\nLeft drawer opened successfully with all Chinese nav items: 菜单, 关闭, 首页/Home, 抽屉一览/Drawers, 统计/Analytics, 通知/Notifications, 设置/Settings.\n\nNow let me screenshot to visually confirm, then close the drawer and test right drawer.\n\nLet me also test right drawer.\n\nNow get bounds for 打开设置 to tap it. But the drawer is open covering left side. Right hamburger at 606-690, 202-286. Tapping it should close left and open right.\n\nLet me tap it and verify.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "ADB=\\"adb -s 127.0.0.1:5555\\"; $ADB shell input tap 648 244; sleep 1; $ADB shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/u5.xml >/dev/null 2>&1; $ADB pull /sdcard/u5.xml $HOME/u5.xml >/dev/null 2>&1; cd $HOME && grep -o 'text=\\"[^\\"]\\\\+\\"' u5.xml \p head -25"}\n结果: text="抽屉式界面 ｜ Drawer UI"\ntext="打开菜单"\ntext="抽屉式界面"\ntext="DRAWER DEMO"\ntext="打开设置"\ntext="抽屉式界面"\ntext="左侧菜单和右侧设置是侧边抽屉，下方木箱是真正的「抽屉」。按下把手就会向前拉出，露出里面的东西。"\ntext="木质收纳柜"\ntext="4 层"\ntext="文件 DOCUMENTS"\ntext="合同、保修卡、收据三件套，按年度用信封装好分隔存放。"\ntext="2026 年度"\ntext="需归还"\ntext="原件"\ntext="工具 TOOLS"\ntext="• "\ntext="螺丝刀（十字・一字 各 3 种规格）"\ntext="• "\ntext="卷尺 5m、内六角扳手套装"\ntext="• "\ntext="扎带、双面胶、美纹纸胶带"\ntext="线缆 CABLES"\ntext="Type-C、Lightning、HDMI、LAN 分别装入小袋并捆扎整齐。"\ntext="Type-C ×4"\ntext="HDMI 2.1"\n\n\nThe right drawer didn't open — instead the left drawer closed. That's because tapping 打开设置 at 648,244: when left drawer is open, the backdrop covers... wait, btnR is at 606-690 which is on the right side, outside the left drawer (561 device width). But the backdrop covers the whole screen with z-index 50, and drawer 60, topbar 40. So backdrop is ABOVE topbar (40 < 50). So tapping anywhere closes the drawer!\n\nThat's actually correct behavior — tapping outside closes. The click went to backdrop, closing the drawer. So btnR wasn't hit.\n\nThat's fine/expected. Now tap 打开设置 again with drawer closed.\n\nAlso note: tapping the topbar buttons while drawer open doesn't work since backdrop covers it. That's acceptable UX (tap outside closes).\n\nNow tap 648,244 again.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "ADB=\\"adb -s 127.0.0.1:5555\\"; $ADB shell input tap 648 244; sleep 1; $ADB shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/u6.xml >/dev/null 2>&1; $ADB pull /sdcard/u6.xml $HOME/u6.xml >/dev/null 2>&1; cd $HOME && grep -o 'text=\\"[^\\"]\\\\+\\"' u6.xml \p head -22"}\n结果: text="抽屉式界面 ｜ Drawer UI"\ntext="打开菜单"\ntext="抽屉式界面"\ntext="DRAWER DEMO"\ntext="打开设置"\ntext="设置"\ntext="关闭"\ntext="浅色主题"\ntext="切换画面配色"\ntext="浅色主题"\ntext="声音"\ntext="播放操作音"\ntext="声音"\ntext="自动展开"\ntext="打开一个即关闭其他"\ntext="自动展开"\ntext="全部关闭"\ntext="把打开的抽屉收回"\ntext="全部关闭"\ntext="抽屉式界面"\ntext="左侧菜单和右侧设置是侧边抽屉，下方木箱是真正的「抽屉」。按下把手就会向前拉出，露出里面的东西。"\ntext="木质收纳柜"\n\n\nRight drawer works: 设置, 关闭, 浅色主题/切换画面配色, 声音/播放操作音, 自动展开/打开一个即关闭其他, 全部关闭/把打开的抽屉收回.\n\nNow close it and test the cabinet drawer open/close. Let me tap backdrop (far left, e.g., 50, 800) to close, then tap 线缆 drawer face.\n\nLet me get bounds of drawer faces.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "ADB=\\"adb -s 127.0.0.1:5555\\"; $ADB shell input tap 60 900; sleep 1; $ADB shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/u7.xml >/dev/null 2>&1; $ADB pull /sdcard/u7.xml $HOME/u7.xml >/dev/null 2>&1; cd $HOME && python3 -c \\"\\nimport re\\ns=open('u7.xml',encoding='utf-8').read()\\nfor m in re.finditer(r'<node[^>]*text=\\\\\\"([^\\\\\\"]*)\\\\\\"[^>]*bounds=\\\\\\"\\\\[(\\\\d+),(\\\\d+)\\\\]\\\\[(\\\\d+),(\\\\d+)\\\\]\\\\\\"',s):\\n    t=m.group(1)\\n    if any(k in t for k in ['线缆','文件','工具','其他','使用方法']):\\n        print(repr(t[:40]), m.group(2),m.group(3),m.group(4),m.group(5))\\n\\""}\n结果: '文件 DOCUMENTS' 60 534 660 668\n'工具 TOOLS' 60 684 660 816\n'线缆 CABLES' 60 832 660 964\n'使用方法&#10;点击把手开合 ・ 点击外侧可关闭侧边抽屉 ・ 设置里也能用「全' 30 1176 690 1362\n\n\nFile drawer is open (default), bounds 534-668. 线缆 at 832-964, center y=898.\n\nLet me tap 线缆 at 360, 898. Then verify: 线缆 content appears (Type-C ×4, HDMI 2.1, 网线 Cat6) and 文件 closes (合同... no longer visible? Actually the text node still exists in DOM but hidden; uiautomator may still show it since it's in the web content accessibility tree — hidden by max-height:0 with overflow hidden, so it should be removed from accessibility tree).\n\nLet me tap and dump.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "ADB=\\"adb -s 127.0.0.1:5555\\"; $ADB shell input tap 360 898; sleep 2; $ADB shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/u8.xml >/dev/null 2>&1; $ADB pull /sdcard/u8.xml $HOME/u8.xml >/dev/null 2>&1; cd $HOME && grep -o 'text=\\"[^\\"]\\\\+\\"' u8.xml \p grep -E \\"文件\p工具\p线缆\p其他\pType\pHDMI\p网线\p合同\p螺丝刀\p类型\\" \p head -20"}\n结果: text="文件 DOCUMENTS"\ntext="合同、保修卡、收据三件套，按年度用信封装好分隔存放。"\ntext="工具 TOOLS"\ntext="螺丝刀（十字・一字 各 3 种规格）"\ntext="线缆 CABLES"\ntext="Type-C、Lightning、HDMI、LAN 分别装入小袋并捆扎整齐。"\ntext="Type-C ×4"\ntext="HDMI 2.1"\ntext="网线 Cat6"\ntext="已打开 其他"\n\n\nHmm, the toast says "已打开 其他" — but I tapped at y=898 which was 线缆 (832-964). Why 其他?\n\nBecause after 文件 closed, the layout shifted UP! When 文件 drawer closes (max-height → 0), everything below moves up. So y=898 now corresponds to a lower drawer (其他).\n\nThat's expected CSS behavior. The tap coordinate was captured *before* the layout change... no, the tap happened first, then layout changed.\n\nWait: at tap time, 文件 was open. 文件 face at 534-668, body below it (668 to ~832?). Actually 文件 body content: paragraph + 3 chips, roughly 130px. So body occupies 668-800ish. Then 工具 at 832? No — the dump showed 工具 TOOLS at 684-816, which overlaps...\n\nHmm the dump said 文件 534-668, 工具 684-816, 线缆 832-964. So 文件's body was between 668 and 684 — only 16px? That means 文件 body was nearly collapsed!\n\nBut OCR showed the 合同... text visible. Hmm, the body max-height set on load. Maybe at dump time it had just been set.\n\nAnyway. After tapping y=898 → that was 线缆's bounds. But result toast = "已打开 其他". So after 文件 closed, positions shifted up by ~文件 body height (~148px), so y=898 → 其他.\n\nWait, but the click target is determined at DOWN time. At DOWN time 线缆 was at 832-964, so it should hit 线缆.\n\nUnless the animation: 文件 closes with transition max-height .45s, then 线缆 face... no, the click is on the element under the touch point at DOWN.\n\nHmm, but actually — maybe 文件 was NOT open at that moment. The earlier tap at 60,900 closed the right drawer. Then dump u7 showed 文件 at 534-668 and 工具 at 684-816. If 文件 body were open (~130px tall), 工具 would start around 668+130=798. Instead it starts at 684. So 文件 body was collapsed (16px = maybe partially). \n\nHmm, but OCR earlier showed 合同 text visible. And ui7 dump — let me check if 合同 text was in u7.\n\nWhatever. The important thing: the tap opened SOME drawer and content shows. The result: toast "已打开 其他", and the dump shows 文件 content still, 工具 content, 线缆 content all present?! That's odd — auto-solo should close others.\n\nActually uiautomator's web accessibility tree may include hidden text since max-height:0 + overflow:hidden might still expose nodes to a11y. Hmm, but it did NOT include 其他's content ("备用电池...").\n\nWait the grep filtered by keywords; 其他 content "备用电池、夹子、便利贴" doesn't match my grep pattern. So maybe all 4 are in the tree.\n\nLet me take a screenshot and OCR to see actual visual state. That's the ground truth.\n\nActually, a cleaner test: tap 其他 again to toggle it closed, then screenshot. Or better: get precise current bounds and tap 线缆 properly.\n\nLet me screenshot + OCR now.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "ADB=\\"adb -s 127.0.0.1:5555\\"; $ADB shell screencap -p /sdcard/v3.png; $ADB pull /sdcard/v3.png $HOME/v3.png >/dev/null 2>&1; cd $HOME && tesseract v3.png out3 -l chi_sim --psm 6 2>/dev/null; cat out3.txt"}\n结果: 21:19:59 名            入 念四全\p GO\nQ_ 名 抽居式界面 \p Dr 交 ) 各\n一 ，抽屠式界面               二\n国   DRAWER DEMO                     四\nen 文件\nDOCUMENTS\n工具              ~\nTOOLS\nLi 线费              因\nCABLES\nType-C、Lightning、HDMI、LAN 分别装入小\n袋并捆扎整齐。\nType-C x4      HDMI 2.1      网线 Cat6\n有\nMISC\n使用方法\n点击把手开合 ， 点击外侧可关闭侧边抽导 。 设置里\n也能用 [全部关闭1\n和 QQO 三    人\n\n\nNow the 线缆 drawer IS open (Type-C ×4, HDMI 2.1, 网线 Cat6 visible) and 文件/工具 are closed. So actually the tap DID open 线缆 — the toast "已打开 其他" was misleading because... hmm, toast text uses `item.querySelector('.drawer-label b').textContent`. \n\nOh! I see the bug: `toast('已打开 ' + item.querySelector('.drawer-label b').textContent)` — that's fine per item.\n\nBut wait, maybe the toast came from a second event? Ugh.\n\nActually — hmm, the visual shows 线缆 open. The toast said 其他. Possibly the accessibility tree/order differs.\n\nHmm, actually: maybe two clicks happened? No.\n\nWait — maybe the tap at (360,898) hit 线缆 as first event... and the toast element updates... Let me reconsider: could `idx` mapping be off? `toast('已打开 ' + item.querySelector('.drawer-label b').textContent)` — item is the clicked item, so text should be 线缆.\n\nUnless the visible state is 线缆 open because... the DOM order is 文件,工具,线缆,其他 and the click landed on 其他, and then 其他 opened... but the screenshot clearly shows 线缆 highlighted with its content expanded, and 其他 MISC appears closed below.\n\nHmm, actually wait. Look at OCR: after "网线 Cat6" comes "有" then "MISC". So there's an item before MISC whose label OCR'd as "有" — that's 其他 (top part cut). So 其他 is closed, 线缆 open.\n\nSo the toast is inconsistent with visual. Let me check: maybe the click fired on 线缆 (opens, toast "已打开 线缆"), and then a SECOND click fired? Because auto-solo closed 文件 first (reducing height), shifting coordinates... but a second click at same coords would hit 其他 and open it (auto-solo would close 线缆) → but 线缆 is open, not 其他.\n\nSo one click → 线缆 opened. Toast should be "已打开 线缆". But dump showed "已打开 其他".\n\nUnless the dump's toast element retained stale text... The toast in u8 dump was 1600ms visible; I dumped at ~2s after tap. Hmm.\n\nWhatever — minor. Actually I realize: the dump u8 was taken 2s after tap; toast auto-hides at 1.6s. So the "已打开 其他" I saw must be a leftover node... no.\n\nLet me not over-analyze. Maybe accessibility tree text for the toast is being confused. Let me do one clean verification: tap 线缆 again (to close), then check 其他 opens properly.\n\nActually more valuable: verify the toggle-close works and 其他 opens. Let me tap 其他.\n\nGet current bounds first.\n\nActually, the visual evidence is solid: 线缆 opened, auto-solo closed others. That's the core functionality verified. Let me do one more: tap 其他 to confirm it opens and closes 线缆.\n\nLet me get bounds.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "ADB=\\"adb -s 127.0.0.1:5555\\"; $ADB shell uiautomator dump /sdcard/u9.xml >/dev/null 2>&1; $ADB pull /sdcard/u9.xml $HOME/u9.xml >/dev/null 2>&1; cd $HOME && python3 -c \\"\\nimport re\\ns=open('u9.xml',encoding='utf-8').read()\\nfor m in re.finditer(r'<node[^>]*text=\\\\\\"([^\\\\\\"]*)\\\\\\"[^>]*bounds=\\\\\\"\\\\[(\\\\d+),(\\\\d+)\\\\]\\\\[(\\\\d+),(\\\\d+)\\\\]\\\\\\"',s):\\n    t=m.group(1)\\n    if any(k in t for k in ['文件 DOC','工具 TOOLS','线缆 CABLES','MISC']):\\n        print(repr(t), m.group(2),m.group(3),m.group(4),m.group(5))\\n\\""}\n结果: (成功，无输出)\n\n🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: {"command": "cd $HOME && grep -o 'text=\\"[^\\"]*\\\\(MISC\\\\\pCABLES\\\\\pTOOLS\\\\\pDOCUMENTS\\\\)[^\\"]*\\"' u9.xml; echo \\"---all texts---\\"; grep -o 'text=\\"[^\\"]\\\\+\\"' u9.xml \p head -40"}\n结果: text="描画：実機ブラウザで読み込み、ページタイトル「引き出し ｜ Drawer UI」をUIツリーから確認。スクリーンショットのOCRで「DOCUMENTS」「TOOLS」「CABLES」「2026年度 要返却 原本」等の描画を確認"\ntext="文件 DOCUMENTS"\ntext="工具 TOOLS"\ntext="线缆 CABLES"\ntext="文件 DOCUMENTS"\ntext="工具 TOOLS"\ntext="线缆 CABLES"\ntext="文件 DOCUMENTS"\ntext="工具 TOOLS"\ntext="线缆 CABLES"\n---all texts---\ntext="DeepSeek Harness"\ntext="☰"\ntext="探索未至之境"\ntext="＋"\ntext="⋯"\ntext="&#128269;"\ntext="正则匹配"\ntext="正则匹配"\ntext="探索"\ntext="21:15"\ntext="&#128279;"\ntext="✕"\ntext="flash TEST"\ntext="09:35"\ntext="&#128279;"\ntext="✕"\ntext="☑️ 多选"\ntext="&#128465;️ 清空全部"\ntext="↑ 加载更早的消息"\ntext="&#129489;"\ntext="醉了"\ntext="18:34"\ntext="&#128203; 复制"\ntext="&#129302;"\ntext="确实，跟一堆垃圾抢搜索结果，谁都会醉。"\ntext="本条回复的真实 token 消耗：来自模型 API 返回的 usage（计费口径），不是本地估算"\ntext="按空闲时段单价计算（空闲=高峰一半）：命中 32,384 / 未命中 208 / 输出 61"\ntext="18:34"\ntext="&#128203; 复制"\ntext="&#128266; 朗读"\ntext="&#129489;"\ntext="不过还好，GitHub上我可以托管我的代码，我把我的仓库设置成了私有"\ntext="一句话回复我"\ntext="18:34"\ntext="&#128203; 复制"\ntext="&#129302;"\ntext="对，私库才是 GitHub 对你最实在的用途——代码有备份、有版本历史，还不用担心被人翻出来。"\ntext="本条回复的真实 token 消耗：来自模型 API 返回的 usage（计费口径），不是本地估算"\ntext="按空闲时段单价计算（空闲=高峰一半）：命中 32,512 / 未命中 166 / 输出 28"\ntext="18:34"\n\n\nThe browser switched back to DeepSeek Harness page! The dump shows the chat app, not our page. So the browser navigated away, or the foreground changed.\n\nHmm — it seems the browser went back to the previous tab/page. Maybe my uiautomator dump interfered? No — more likely the browser switched to another tab.\n\nWait, earlier dumps worked. Now it shows "DeepSeek Harness" chat page. So something navigated.\n\nPossibly my tap at 360,898 (or 60,900) hit something that switched tabs? Or the browser's back gesture?\n\nRegardless — I already verified:\n1. Page renders in Chinese (OCR confirmed)\n2. Left drawer opens with Chinese nav items\n3. Right drawer opens with Chinese settings\n4. 线缆 drawer expands showing Chinese content, auto-solo closes others\n\nThat's sufficient functional verification.\n\nLet me reload the page once more and take a final screenshot to confirm everything is fine, then clean up.\n\nActually, let me be efficient: reload and screenshot once.🔧 调用工具: execute_command\n参数: