lass="kongjian"></a><a class="weibo"></a><a class="weixin"></a></div>\n			</div>\n		</div>\n		<div class="title18847"><!-- 移动端 -->\n			<div class="title_con">\n				\n						<div id="content">\n							<div class="contit"><span>主要内容<b></b><i></i></span></div>\n						<div class="content_area" id="content_area"><p><strong>央视网消息</strong>（新闻联播）：今天（11月1日），西藏那曲市巴青县7.0级地震受灾最严重的玛如乡、岗切乡所需过渡安置板房已全部搭建完毕，需转移安置的受灾群众已全部入住。灾区首批589名师生启程前往拉萨开展异地复课，明后天还将有近千名师生分批前往拉萨复课。</p></div>			\n						<div class="zebian"><i></i>\n							<span>编辑：刘珊</span>\n							<span id="zb">责任编辑：刘亮</span>\n						</div>\n						<script type="text/javascript">			\n							if ($.trim($("#content_area").html())==""){\n								$("#content").css("display","none");\n							}\n						</script>\n						<script type="text/javascript">\n							var zeditor = '刘亮';\n							if (zeditor==""){\n								$("#zb").css("display","none");\n							}\n						</script>\n						</div>\n				\n			</div>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class="XUQIU18897_pinglun">\n	<!-- 移动端评论展示 -->\n	<div class="comment">\n		<div class="md_0724 pnone" >\n			<div class="md_hd">\n				<span class="mh_title"><i>全部评论</i></span>\n			</div>\n			<div class="md_bd">\n				<div class="ind_pinlun">\n					<ul>\n					</ul>\n					<div class="loading"><div class="loadingmore"><i></i><p><a>查看更多评论</a></p><div style="clear:both;"></div></div></div>\n				</div>\n			</div>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<!-- 评论 -->\n	<!-- 评论结束 -->\n</div>\n	<!-- 移动返回顶部 -->\n	<div id="back_to_top" class="gotop_btn"></div>\n	<div id="back_to_home" class="gohome"><a href="http://www.cctv.com"></a></div>\n	<script type="text/javascript" src="//r.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1636592527650783/cctvnew_video_h5.js?ccceedd2"></script>\n	<!--移动pc公用模块-->\n	<div class="XUQIU18897_tonglan">\n		<div class="column_wrapper_1000">\n			\n<div class="BottomPageUniversal18897_ind01" id="BottomPageUniversal18897_ind01">\n\n	<div class="swiper-container">\n		<ul class="swiper-wrapper">\n			\n<li class="swiper-slide"><a c